(1037273, 124776, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too much white. The snowflakes lose all their impact because you can''t see them.</td>', 'Too much white. The snowflakes lose all their impact because you can''t see them.', '2004-11-30 00:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037275, 124167, 29486, '<td valign="top">The photo isn''t cropped right and the color doesn''t help. Most import is that you recognize what it is. The color makes that hard, the angle makes it harder, and you are not quite close enought to really read the text.  If you had a tighter crop so that some of the text stood out or went with a looser crop to show the whole device, I would probably like it better.</td>', 'The photo isn''t cropped right and the color doesn''t help. Most import is that you recognize what it is. The color makes that hard, the angle makes it harder, and you are not quite close enought to really read the text.  If you had a tighter crop so that some of the text stood out or went with a looser crop to show the whole device, I would probably like it better.', '2004-11-30 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037279, 122388, 29486, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and it''s clear but the subject is not interesting for me.</td>', 'Good lighting and it''s clear but the subject is not interesting for me.', '2004-11-30 00:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037281, 124880, 29486, '<td valign="top">OK, I totally don''t get it. I suppose the fire hydrant is the subject but what''s the deal with the background?  Why is that important, i.e., what does it add to the picture?  The focus is soft on the hydrant and the background is way too in focus. Just overall uninteresting and confusing.</td>', 'OK, I totally don''t get it. I suppose the fire hydrant is the subject but what''s the deal with the background?  Why is that important, i.e., what does it add to the picture?  The focus is soft on the hydrant and the background is way too in focus. Just overall uninteresting and confusing.', '2004-11-30 00:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037283, 124603, 23913, '<td valign="top">hey man wireless mics. are still powered by electricty.<br/> <br/>the shot is cool though GL</td>', 'hey man wireless mics. are still powered by electricty. the shot is cool though GL', '2004-11-30 00:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037284, 123484, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice double entendre with your title. I like this image. It is creative, edgy, and risky. It also shows intelligence. Very refreshing.  There is a little too much white space at the tope of the image for me. It gives me a sense that the image is somehow falling. Other than that smidgen of a complaint, stunning image.</td>', 'Nice double entendre with your title. I like this image. It is creative, edgy, and risky. It also shows intelligence. Very refreshing.  There is a little too much white space at the tope of the image for me. It gives me a sense that the image is somehow falling. Other than that smidgen of a complaint, stunning image.', '2004-11-30 00:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037285, 124292, 23913, '<td valign="top">its no TI 83+ but it use to do the job nice shot goo idea.</td>', 'its no TI 83+ but it use to do the job nice shot goo idea.', '2004-11-30 00:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037286, 124042, 29486, '<td valign="top">Hard to make your subject do very much but all in all a decent photo with some good lighting.</td>', 'Hard to make your subject do very much but all in all a decent photo with some good lighting.', '2004-11-30 00:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037287, 124603, 28108, '<td valign="top">Hum the microphone and the ear piece takes a bit of the "Low Tech" aura away. Still a very nice picture.</td>', 'Hum the microphone and the ear piece takes a bit of the "Low Tech" aura away. Still a very nice picture.', '2004-11-30 00:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037288, 122834, 29486, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color. Paymaster is visible letting you know what it is. Decent photo.</td>', 'Interesting use of color. Paymaster is visible letting you know what it is. Decent photo.', '2004-11-30 00:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037289, 124525, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The image is a little too cluttered for me; it takes away from your main subject. The old toaster, some toast and some crumbs would have sufficed. I like the monochromatic orangish-hinting-at-sepia but a tad more edgy hue. I like the origin of your light source. Since it comes from the left, it evokes the feeling of morning for me, which goes well with your image.</td>', 'Great idea. The image is a little too cluttered for me; it takes away from your main subject. The old toaster, some toast and some crumbs would have sufficed. I like the monochromatic orangish-hinting-at-sepia but a tad more edgy hue. I like the origin of your light source. Since it comes from the left, it evokes the feeling of morning for me, which goes well with your image.', '2004-11-30 00:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037293, 124371, 29486, '<td valign="top">The selective coloring seems to help the photo. Everything seems very clean. Good job.</td>', 'The selective coloring seems to help the photo. Everything seems very clean. Good job.', '2004-11-30 00:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037295, 124904, 22384, '<td valign="top">These things amaze me. It blew me away to watch them use slide rules on Apollo 13. The convenient carrying case is a perfect element, as well as the graph paper background. The X shape of your subjects is also linear and mathematical. A great deal of thought went into this shot. I would have liked to see all the shadows eliminated so that it appeared even more clean and polished.</td>', 'These things amaze me. It blew me away to watch them use slide rules on Apollo 13. The convenient carrying case is a perfect element, as well as the graph paper background. The X shape of your subjects is also linear and mathematical. A great deal of thought went into this shot. I would have liked to see all the shadows eliminated so that it appeared even more clean and polished.', '2004-11-30 01:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037296, 124904, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and placement of items. No real pizazz though.</td>', 'Nice lighting and placement of items. No real pizazz though.', '2004-11-30 01:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037297, 123522, 23913, '<td valign="top">i don''t think the pump needs that much saturation a little desat. would have been nice its just too red.<br/>i think that backround could make anything standout w/o having to saturate it(the subject) that much-GL nice shot</td>', 'i don''t think the pump needs that much saturation a little desat. would have been nice its just too red.i think that backround could make anything standout w/o having to saturate it(the subject) that much-GL nice shot', '2004-11-30 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037298, 121696, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of motif, composition and color. Stiking image.</td>', 'Brilliant use of motif, composition and color. Stiking image.', '2004-11-30 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037299, 124447, 23913, '<td valign="top">kinda low res. but thats prob b/c of the 150kb requirement anyway nice freez action cool shot</td>', 'kinda low res. but thats prob b/c of the 150kb requirement anyway nice freez action cool shot', '2004-11-30 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037300, 124985, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image looks to me like the man is protesting something. I get the feeling of banning or burning books for some reason. I think that it is his expression and that he is facing left, which could simply mean that he is looking back to the past when people read more. It is his expression that throws the image for me.</td>', 'This image looks to me like the man is protesting something. I get the feeling of banning or burning books for some reason. I think that it is his expression and that he is facing left, which could simply mean that he is looking back to the past when people read more. It is his expression that throws the image for me.', '2004-11-30 01:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037301, 124524, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice shot cool image great angle-GL</td>', 'nice shot cool image great angle-GL', '2004-11-30 01:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037302, 124145, 15511, '<td valign="top">Still, it''s electronic.</td>', 'Still, it''s electronic.', '2004-11-30 01:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037307, 123451, 29486, '<td valign="top">OK, I totally don''t get it. Non electric items is the topic but you have electric lights. I need explanation to remove my poor vote for violating the topic rules. If these are gas lights then I would have expected the title to indicate that.</td>', 'OK, I totally don''t get it. Non electric items is the topic but you have electric lights. I need explanation to remove my poor vote for violating the topic rules. If these are gas lights then I would have expected the title to indicate that.', '2004-11-30 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037308, 124084, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice shot alittle more saturation or contrast could be cool. but great image</td>', 'nice shot alittle more saturation or contrast could be cool. but great image', '2004-11-30 01:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037309, 124888, 15511, '<td valign="top">This works and the title is so fitting.</td>', 'This works and the title is so fitting.', '2004-11-30 01:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037310, 124460, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea and use of color. I just so want that popcorn that is in the air to be crisp and tightly focused. That would make this image rock. The framing is a little too much in the center for me. I would play around with the cropping to see what creates the most energy and evokes the most interest.</td>', 'Great idea and use of color. I just so want that popcorn that is in the air to be crisp and tightly focused. That would make this image rock. The framing is a little too much in the center for me. I would play around with the cropping to see what creates the most energy and evokes the most interest.', '2004-11-30 01:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037313, 123794, 23913, '<td valign="top">ADT has nothing on that</td>', 'ADT has nothing on that', '2004-11-30 01:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037315, 124196, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant idea. Clean up the stray hairs and maybe burn the neck so that it doesn''t look so blown out.</td>', 'Simple and elegant idea. Clean up the stray hairs and maybe burn the neck so that it doesn''t look so blown out.', '2004-11-30 01:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037316, 123029, 23913, '<td valign="top">and for lots still is...... nice shot-GL</td>', 'and for lots still is...... nice shot-GL', '2004-11-30 01:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037319, 121880, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of textures and shapes, the rigid bends of the paperclip and the elegant curves of the rubberband complement each other well. I would like to see the shadow underneath the objects eliminated but not the shadow on th rubberband. This is a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice contrast of textures and shapes, the rigid bends of the paperclip and the elegant curves of the rubberband complement each other well. I would like to see the shadow underneath the objects eliminated but not the shadow on th rubberband. This is a nice shot.', '2004-11-30 01:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037320, 122432, 29486, '<td valign="top">Now that is one way to put interest in an otherwise dull item. Nice job.</td>', 'Now that is one way to put interest in an otherwise dull item. Nice job.', '2004-11-30 01:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037321, 124926, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice shot good grayscale, a macro would have been cool too.</td>', 'nice shot good grayscale, a macro would have been cool too.', '2004-11-30 01:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
