(1037704, 124654, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s sucha  cool shot but nothing electric was to be submitted, sorry you lose points for that.</td>', 'It''s sucha  cool shot but nothing electric was to be submitted, sorry you lose points for that.', '2004-11-30 07:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
