(1037723, 122505, 29535, '<td valign="top">I think you shouldn''t have cut off the top of the spade, and perhaps cut off some of the bottom.  But good ideas, nice shot.</td>', 'I think you shouldn''t have cut off the top of the spade, and perhaps cut off some of the bottom.  But good ideas, nice shot.', '2004-11-30 07:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
