(1037726, 123357, 29535, '<td valign="top">I really think you should have included a needle, as technically that is what would have been used to sew it, but I''ll let that go.  Great idea, well done.</td>', 'I really think you should have included a needle, as technically that is what would have been used to sew it, but I''ll let that go.  Great idea, well done.', '2004-11-30 07:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
