(1037728, 123659, 29535, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the selective desat here, it''s being overdone.  Save it to bring attention to a small detail in a B&amp;W scene, not just to draw the eye.  The background blur looks poorly edited also, leading me to believe there was none on the original.  Ah well, nice idea.  I like the contrast between the ultra modern woman and the old fashioned bike.</td>', 'I don''t like the selective desat here, it''s being overdone.  Save it to bring attention to a small detail in a B&W scene, not just to draw the eye.  The background blur looks poorly edited also, leading me to believe there was none on the original.  Ah well, nice idea.  I like the contrast between the ultra modern woman and the old fashioned bike.', '2004-11-30 07:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037730, 123697, 29535, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Great idea!</td>', 'Nice!  Great idea!', '2004-11-30 07:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037744, 124525, 164, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the color but concept is good</td>', 'Not sure I like the color but concept is good', '2004-11-30 07:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037755, 124697, 22533, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic, but I would have cloned out the electricity wire. Some people may ding you for that. GREAT JOB.</td>', 'Very nice pic, but I would have cloned out the electricity wire. Some people may ding you for that. GREAT JOB.', '2004-11-30 08:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
