(1037871, 123278, 27574, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very nice , the colors are very deep and rich.  One biggie is getting the vertical and horizontal straight and that is the first thing that caught my eye here...the horizontal in not crooked.</td>', 'The lighting is very nice , the colors are very deep and rich.  One biggie is getting the vertical and horizontal straight and that is the first thing that caught my eye here...the horizontal in not crooked.', '2004-11-30 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
