(1037894, 124371, 29945, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp clean shot with very good composition. Like the way you removed the color from everything but the wagon. Geesh I need better software! Gave you a very stingy 10..</td>', 'Nice crisp clean shot with very good composition. Like the way you removed the color from everything but the wagon. Geesh I need better software! Gave you a very stingy 10..', '2004-11-30 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037897, 124666, 29945, '<td valign="top">very good try gave you a 8</td>', 'very good try gave you a 8', '2004-11-30 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037903, 123241, 20679, '<td valign="top">Happy memories! My first camera and the BEST possible way to learn how to compute aperture and shutter speed! Manual everything, built like a tank and I made some really great photos with the thing. The first thing I bought after I got a part time job in 1973 - cost me £30.00. Nice job of photographing it!</td>', 'Happy memories! My first camera and the BEST possible way to learn how to compute aperture and shutter speed! Manual everything, built like a tank and I made some really great photos with the thing. The first thing I bought after I got a part time job in 1973 - cost me £30.00. Nice job of photographing it!', '2004-11-30 10:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037906, 123732, 16648, '<td valign="top">A few hot spots, otherwise very nice.</td>', 'A few hot spots, otherwise very nice.', '2004-11-30 10:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037909, 124965, 14763, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  very nice</td>', 'Great capture.  very nice', '2004-11-30 10:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037912, 124987, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit dark for my taste - better lighting would help alot in that. The crop..the top of the toolbox is not showing, but the latch is there and wanting my eye - could be better.<br/>I see lots of jaggies - not sure if it is ajpg issue, a lighting on the wood grain issue or imporper sharpening.</td>', 'A bit dark for my taste - better lighting would help alot in that. The crop..the top of the toolbox is not showing, but the latch is there and wanting my eye - could be better.I see lots of jaggies - not sure if it is ajpg issue, a lighting on the wood grain issue or imporper sharpening.', '2004-11-30 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037914, 124260, 16648, '<td valign="top">too small. One of the last things to do before saving the pic is to resize it. Ignore DPI, just go with total pixels - make the long side 640 or there abouts.  When you save it, shoot for 147k or less - depends on your software how you achive that, but adjusting compression level is how it is generally done.</td>', 'too small. One of the last things to do before saving the pic is to resize it. Ignore DPI, just go with total pixels - make the long side 640 or there abouts.  When you save it, shoot for 147k or less - depends on your software how you achive that, but adjusting compression level is how it is generally done.', '2004-11-30 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037917, 124707, 16648, '<td valign="top">I prefer a photo to look like a photo, at leat in challenges. I totally understand the urge to try and make a pic more interesting with effects, but it usually doesn;t work here.</td>', 'I prefer a photo to look like a photo, at leat in challenges. I totally understand the urge to try and make a pic more interesting with effects, but it usually doesn;t work here.', '2004-11-30 10:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037920, 124572, 16648, '<td valign="top">I''d like more DOF in this shot. Maybe more saturation as well</td>', 'I''d like more DOF in this shot. Maybe more saturation as well', '2004-11-30 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037923, 124493, 16648, '<td valign="top">I like the border. I like the shadows. Not sure i like the high key/ over exposed banana and gourd on the left though.</td>', 'I like the border. I like the shadows. Not sure i like the high key/ over exposed banana and gourd on the left though.', '2004-11-30 10:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037925, 121696, 3102, '<td valign="top">The only thing keeping me from giving this a 10 is the excessive border.  I love the texture and tones here!</td>', 'The only thing keeping me from giving this a 10 is the excessive border.  I love the texture and tones here!', '2004-11-30 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037926, 122267, 16648, '<td valign="top">Ooh i recently learned something that might help this pic - open it in PS or similar and try USM of 30-40%, radius 60-70 and threshhold 0. It works well to remove  ''haze''. This challenge allows advanced editing...there are things you could have done to improve the dynamic range of this shot - the sky is too light and some of the iron is too dark, losing all details.  Try  //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html - '' shudder sharpening'' - see my recent portfolio additions for what it can do. This could also stand to be a bit bigger - on height i try for 600 pixels (bigger means i have to scroll to see the whol pic so that is my boundary.)</td>', 'Ooh i recently learned something that might help this pic - open it in PS or similar and try USM of 30-40%, radius 60-70 and threshhold 0. It works well to remove  ''haze''. This challenge allows advanced editing...there are things you could have done to improve the dynamic range of this shot - the sky is too light and some of the iron is too dark, losing all details.  Try  //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html - '' shudder sharpening'' - see my recent portfolio additions for what it can do. This could also stand to be a bit bigger - on height i try for 600 pixels (bigger means i have to scroll to see the whol pic so that is my boundary.)', '2004-11-30 10:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037930, 124970, 16648, '<td valign="top">Want to imnprove this pic by 50%? Open it as is in PS and do a USM with settings of Amount 30%, radius 60 and T-Hold of 0.  It removes the haze i see in this pic. Much more ''pop'' after that.</td>', 'Want to imnprove this pic by 50%? Open it as is in PS and do a USM with settings of Amount 30%, radius 60 and T-Hold of 0.  It removes the haze i see in this pic. Much more ''pop'' after that.', '2004-11-30 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037931, 124984, 27562, '<td valign="top">Air Coolers rule! ;-)</td>', 'Air Coolers rule! ;-)', '2004-11-30 10:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037934, 123713, 16648, '<td valign="top">Ummm, very electronic. An acoustic guitar might have been a better choice. This sucker wasn''t invented until after electronics ''cause you need them to make an amp, and without an amp this is not much of a musical instrument.</td>', 'Ummm, very electronic. An acoustic guitar might have been a better choice. This sucker wasn''t invented until after electronics ''cause you need them to make an amp, and without an amp this is not much of a musical instrument.', '2004-11-30 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037936, 124202, 16648, '<td valign="top">Very bright and colorful. Perhaps ctop a bit to remove the tree in the left side? Seems a tad oversharpened too, but that could be the sun. There is some noise in the sky, check out neat image.</td>', 'Very bright and colorful. Perhaps ctop a bit to remove the tree in the left side? Seems a tad oversharpened too, but that could be the sun. There is some noise in the sky, check out neat image.', '2004-11-30 10:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037937, 124776, 16648, '<td valign="top">I see a haze on this pic - try USM 30%, 60, 0 and see what you think.</td>', 'I see a haze on this pic - try USM 30%, 60, 0 and see what you think.', '2004-11-30 10:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037939, 122505, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I would suggest either a tighter crop with the shove handle (metal part not the wooden part of the handle)  cropped out or reframing with the complete handle in the image.  Being on the edge is slightly distracting.  Beautiful lighting.  Good Work!</td>', 'Nice image.  I would suggest either a tighter crop with the shove handle (metal part not the wooden part of the handle)  cropped out or reframing with the complete handle in the image.  Being on the edge is slightly distracting.  Beautiful lighting.  Good Work!', '2004-11-30 10:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037940, 124819, 16648, '<td valign="top">I see a bit of haze on the pic (USM 30%, 60, 0) will remove it, but then the left egg and beater handle start to blow out. That can be fixed in other ways, but try it to see how nice the glass bowl liooks.  <br/> <br/>Ver nice composition, coloring and border.</td>', 'I see a bit of haze on the pic (USM 30%, 60, 0) will remove it, but then the left egg and beater handle start to blow out. That can be fixed in other ways, but try it to see how nice the glass bowl liooks.   Ver nice composition, coloring and border.', '2004-11-30 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037942, 122389, 27562, '<td valign="top">Impressive that you retain sharpness with the bell ringing.</td>', 'Impressive that you retain sharpness with the bell ringing.', '2004-11-30 10:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037949, 124136, 27562, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and subject.  Too bad the sky wasnt more interesting that day.  Good Work.</td>', 'Interesting composition and subject.  Too bad the sky wasnt more interesting that day.  Good Work.', '2004-11-30 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037954, 122552, 16648, '<td valign="top">If only the water had some color... //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html has a PS action (and ones for other editors) that work wonders - check my recent portfolio additions for the  best i coud do vs Shudder''s Sharpening (and color punch up, haze removal)</td>', 'If only the water had some color... //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html has a PS action (and ones for other editors) that work wonders - check my recent portfolio additions for the  best i coud do vs Shudder''s Sharpening (and color punch up, haze removal)', '2004-11-30 10:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037958, 124904, 16648, '<td valign="top">Try running this through USM with settings of 40%, 60, and 0 (amount, radius, threshold) and see what you think. Makes it ''pop'' a bit more in my opinion.</td>', 'Try running this through USM with settings of 40%, 60, and 0 (amount, radius, threshold) and see what you think. Makes it ''pop'' a bit more in my opinion.', '2004-11-30 11:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037959, 123903, 27562, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2004-11-30 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037961, 124671, 27562, '<td valign="top">Interesting Perspective.</td>', 'Interesting Perspective.', '2004-11-30 11:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037963, 121834, 16648, '<td valign="top">Hmm, did you mean Mesopotamian? Focus is off here - i think the camera grabbed the ground not the wheel as what should be in focus. More DOF would have helped or perhaps manual focus. Perhaps rotate the picture to ass some interest.</td>', 'Hmm, did you mean Mesopotamian? Focus is off here - i think the camera grabbed the ground not the wheel as what should be in focus. More DOF would have helped or perhaps manual focus. Perhaps rotate the picture to ass some interest.', '2004-11-30 11:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037965, 124981, 16648, '<td valign="top">You need some more light in the pic -the flames are very overexposed and hte candle sticks are too dark. the red canndle in particular is noisy / grainy.</td>', 'You need some more light in the pic -the flames are very overexposed and hte candle sticks are too dark. the red canndle in particular is noisy / grainy.', '2004-11-30 11:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037971, 124883, 16648, '<td valign="top">I see lots of jpg issues in teh sky. You compressd it WAY too much - this is a 30k file! You can be 4 times bigger and still be well under the 147k limit.  Anyway, go to //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html and check out the Shudder Sharpening. I ran your pic through it and without making any manual adjustments got a much more dramatic result. The sky is still a problem, but the rest is, well Wow! I can email it to you and you tell me what you think. If you need help/advice on sizing or compression just ask.<br/></td>', 'I see lots of jpg issues in teh sky. You compressd it WAY too much - this is a 30k file! You can be 4 times bigger and still be well under the 147k limit.  Anyway, go to //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html and check out the Shudder Sharpening. I ran your pic through it and without making any manual adjustments got a much more dramatic result. The sky is still a problem, but the rest is, well Wow! I can email it to you and you tell me what you think. If you need help/advice on sizing or compression just ask.', '2004-11-30 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037973, 123659, 16648, '<td valign="top">No electronics. Isn;t that a quartz wath she is wearing? And i see cars...just kidding. Very nice.</td>', 'No electronics. Isn;t that a quartz wath she is wearing? And i see cars...just kidding. Very nice.', '2004-11-30 11:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037978, 124803, 16648, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversharpened (pump, bell). The sky is noisy too.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversharpened (pump, bell). The sky is noisy too.', '2004-11-30 11:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037982, 121816, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit too small. Make re-sizing the last step - 640 on the long side. Ignore DPI completely. Then when yousave it as a JPG, youshould adjsut the compression to get it to 147K or a bit less.</td>', 'A bit too small. Make re-sizing the last step - 640 on the long side. Ignore DPI completely. Then when yousave it as a JPG, youshould adjsut the compression to get it to 147K or a bit less.', '2004-11-30 11:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037987, 124880, 16648, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this fits the challnge well, but that may be my interpretaion, so no penalty. However, the hydrant does not appear sharp, or perhaps not in focus. The lam post (glass) does not appear real, the grass seems odd - i suspect you did some type of post processing to get an effect, and well, my 2 cents is I don''t like the effect.</td>', 'I don''t think this fits the challnge well, but that may be my interpretaion, so no penalty. However, the hydrant does not appear sharp, or perhaps not in focus. The lam post (glass) does not appear real, the grass seems odd - i suspect you did some type of post processing to get an effect, and well, my 2 cents is I don''t like the effect.', '2004-11-30 11:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037991, 124697, 16648, '<td valign="top">The pic is crooked. The back of the tractor is too dark, all detial is lost and the black hole there draws my eye. With the advanced editing permissible in this challenge, you should have been able to correct that and still keepthe chimney side from blowing out. Now then, there was some discussion in the forums about this challenge and it was pretty much a concensus that cars/trucks/tractors (engines..) don''t meet it. Perhaps an old steel wheeled Fordson or Deere, or something with steam power...</td>', 'The pic is crooked. The back of the tractor is too dark, all detial is lost and the black hole there draws my eye. With the advanced editing permissible in this challenge, you should have been able to correct that and still keepthe chimney side from blowing out. Now then, there was some discussion in the forums about this challenge and it was pretty much a concensus that cars/trucks/tractors (engines..) don''t meet it. Perhaps an old steel wheeled Fordson or Deere, or something with steam power...', '2004-11-30 11:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037995, 121778, 16648, '<td valign="top">I get this scores well. Shots with these blinds inthem always do well. Must get some blinds like this!</td>', 'I get this scores well. Shots with these blinds inthem always do well. Must get some blinds like this!', '2004-11-30 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038001, 122656, 16126, '<td valign="top">Come on, if you really want to photograph someone with a flute, at least have her holding the instrument correctly. That is, pointing to the right and with your left hand closest to the head joint.</td>', 'Come on, if you really want to photograph someone with a flute, at least have her holding the instrument correctly. That is, pointing to the right and with your left hand closest to the head joint.', '2004-11-30 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038004, 124965, 16648, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. If onlt you could have moved the tug!  The sky and masts are fantastic, the hull less so. I tried playing with it  (using //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html Shudder Sharpening) and can make it more dramatic and help the waterline abit, but not sure if it is better or not - very much a judgement call. Seems a bit hazy or ?</td>', 'Really cool shot. If onlt you could have moved the tug!  The sky and masts are fantastic, the hull less so. I tried playing with it  (using //davegage.com/mmc/digi-darkroom.html Shudder Sharpening) and can make it more dramatic and help the waterline abit, but not sure if it is better or not - very much a judgement call. Seems a bit hazy or ?', '2004-11-30 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038026, 124876, 18667, '<td valign="top">I like this picture quite a lot.  I do think the wrench blends in with the background a bit much though ad the shadows are distracting.  I like the composition enough to keep the score high.  Fine work.</td>', 'I like this picture quite a lot.  I do think the wrench blends in with the background a bit much though ad the shadows are distracting.  I like the composition enough to keep the score high.  Fine work.', '2004-11-30 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038038, 124863, 16648, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit dull / hazy - try USM amount 30%, radius 60 and t-hold 0.  The back and undercarriage of hte buggy are still abit dark/dull, but that is another adjustment. Nice composition, lighting (time of day choice)</td>', 'Seems a bit dull / hazy - try USM amount 30%, radius 60 and t-hold 0.  The back and undercarriage of hte buggy are still abit dark/dull, but that is another adjustment. Nice composition, lighting (time of day choice)', '2004-11-30 11:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038041, 124880, 24846, '<td valign="top">Good composition and definitely low tech.</td>', 'Good composition and definitely low tech.', '2004-11-30 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
