(1038048, 122672, 16648, '<td valign="top">the upperleft is bit overexposed, the lower right is under. Lots of dynamic range here, and it leaves the oveallpic a bit hazy - my attempts at adusting it blow out the bowl top rim and the upper left. More DOF perhaps too - the lower left is not in sharp focus. Cropped a bit tight for me too.</td>', 'the upperleft is bit overexposed, the lower right is under. Lots of dynamic range here, and it leaves the oveallpic a bit hazy - my attempts at adusting it blow out the bowl top rim and the upper left. More DOF perhaps too - the lower left is not in sharp focus. Cropped a bit tight for me too.', '2004-11-30 12:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
