(1038632, 124883, 29607, '<td valign="top">I think this looks great.  It eprfectly captures the chilly November evening and the solitude of the lighthouse.  Beautiful!</td>', 'I think this looks great.  It eprfectly captures the chilly November evening and the solitude of the lighthouse.  Beautiful!', '2004-11-30 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
