(1038836, 124987, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this. The colors speak volumes. Dark background is effective. It looks like there are some jpg artifacts that distract a bit.</td>', 'I like the feel of this. The colors speak volumes. Dark background is effective. It looks like there are some jpg artifacts that distract a bit.', '2004-11-30 18:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038839, 124637, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Fits the challenge well. Good choice of colors and background. Terrific focus and DOF. Well captured and presented.</td>', 'Very nice. Fits the challenge well. Good choice of colors and background. Terrific focus and DOF. Well captured and presented.', '2004-11-30 18:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038849, 124665, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Good emotive subject, caught in mid-strike. Colors reinforce the old-time feeling. I might have cropped a bit off the right but it''s still a terrific entry as is. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Good emotive subject, caught in mid-strike. Colors reinforce the old-time feeling. I might have cropped a bit off the right but it''s still a terrific entry as is. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-30 18:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038858, 123940, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Nicely captured. Very good color processing. Focus spot on. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Great subject. Nicely captured. Very good color processing. Focus spot on. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-30 18:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038864, 121739, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge. Well composed and focused. I am generally not a fan of borders but this one seems to work. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge. Well composed and focused. I am generally not a fan of borders but this one seems to work. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-30 18:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038866, 123713, 11653, '<td valign="top">Does not meet challenge but is a nice image.</td>', 'Does not meet challenge but is a nice image.', '2004-11-30 18:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038868, 123522, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice use of desat</td>', 'Nice use of desat', '2004-11-30 18:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038869, 122656, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like this, though I''m not sure it fits the theme that well.<br/> <br/>Not sure if it''s intentional, but I''m highly amused by the fact that she''s playing the flute backwards.</td>', 'I like this, though I''m not sure it fits the theme that well. Not sure if it''s intentional, but I''m highly amused by the fact that she''s playing the flute backwards.', '2004-11-30 18:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038872, 124853, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choice of subjects. Focus on wax is superb. Nice reflections bring a sharp white point into the photo which helps. Overall composition good. I suspect you chose DOF intentionally but IMO it would be a little better if the handle was also in sharp focus. Just personal preference. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Wonderful choice of subjects. Focus on wax is superb. Nice reflections bring a sharp white point into the photo which helps. Overall composition good. I suspect you chose DOF intentionally but IMO it would be a little better if the handle was also in sharp focus. Just personal preference. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-30 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038883, 123975, 11653, '<td valign="top">Image is too small</td>', 'Image is too small', '2004-11-30 18:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038891, 124260, 11653, '<td valign="top">Image is too small. Also more contrast between the can  and the background would improve image</td>', 'Image is too small. Also more contrast between the can  and the background would improve image', '2004-11-30 18:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038892, 123093, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of a pefect subject. Very nice definition of the body of the locomotive -- rivits, pipes and all.  It would be better if the sky wasn''t blown out, IMO. A friend of mine owns a working antique steam locomotive. I have ridden in the cab on the foot plate. Fascinating experience I hope you can enjoy if you haven''t already. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Very nice capture of a pefect subject. Very nice definition of the body of the locomotive -- rivits, pipes and all.  It would be better if the sky wasn''t blown out, IMO. A friend of mine owns a working antique steam locomotive. I have ridden in the cab on the foot plate. Fascinating experience I hope you can enjoy if you haven''t already. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-30 18:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038896, 124757, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The contrast between white points and the rest of the image makes it quite appealing and dramitic. Motion blur also helps with the dynamic feel. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I like this very much. The contrast between white points and the rest of the image makes it quite appealing and dramitic. Motion blur also helps with the dynamic feel. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-30 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038906, 124984, 18197, '<td valign="top">Plenty of electronics here, so doesn''t meet challenge IMO. Nice photo though.</td>', 'Plenty of electronics here, so doesn''t meet challenge IMO. Nice photo though.', '2004-11-30 18:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1038910, 123050, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Focus and DOF are good. Doesn''t feel very "low tech" to me but that doesn''t diminish the photo.</td>', 'Nice composition. Focus and DOF are good. Doesn''t feel very "low tech" to me but that doesn''t diminish the photo.', '2004-11-30 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
