(1039322, 123357, 10432, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but I think it would have had more interest if there had been a needle or two in the shot.  Show some sewing devices along with the thread and buttons.<br/>Nicely sharp!</td>', 'Nice concept but I think it would have had more interest if there had been a needle or two in the shot.  Show some sewing devices along with the thread and buttons.Nicely sharp!', '2004-11-30 22:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039323, 123050, 10432, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft and I think I would have liked to have seen the horses full face.  It just seems an awkward crop.  Colors are pretty and background blur looks good.  I also like the way the hair sweeps to one side on the head.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft and I think I would have liked to have seen the horses full face.  It just seems an awkward crop.  Colors are pretty and background blur looks good.  I also like the way the hair sweeps to one side on the head.', '2004-11-30 22:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039324, 124515, 27763, '<td valign="top">yes, this is a good example of low tech, but i think this photo would look much better if you shot it at a more interesting angle (i.e. not straight on).  or maybe you could have cropped out the handles, and just shown the mechanism portion.  it''s just not very interesting to me as it is shown here. just my opinion.  please, keep trying!</td>', 'yes, this is a good example of low tech, but i think this photo would look much better if you shot it at a more interesting angle (i.e. not straight on).  or maybe you could have cropped out the handles, and just shown the mechanism portion.  it''s just not very interesting to me as it is shown here. just my opinion.  please, keep trying!', '2004-11-30 22:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039327, 122776, 10432, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Excellent color, clarity and composition.  I like this very much!!</td>', 'Beautiful.  Excellent color, clarity and composition.  I like this very much!!', '2004-11-30 22:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039348, 124153, 6667, '<td valign="top">Excellent  reference to the theme and a clear photo. I realize this was taken on a photo table and you may have not been able to pull back but. . . but the fact that you didn''t left the cropping too congested cutting off the handle and the base.  I also think less background light would have dramatically emphasized the coals.   The flames definitely add to the scene.  BOL</td>', 'Excellent  reference to the theme and a clear photo. I realize this was taken on a photo table and you may have not been able to pull back but. . . but the fact that you didn''t left the cropping too congested cutting off the handle and the base.  I also think less background light would have dramatically emphasized the coals.   The flames definitely add to the scene.  BOL', '2004-11-30 23:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039353, 124623, 27850, '<td valign="top">I really think you captured the spirit of the challenge. Gorgeous shot with nice details as well. Can''t wait to see what lens you used for this. well done!</td>', 'I really think you captured the spirit of the challenge. Gorgeous shot with nice details as well. Can''t wait to see what lens you used for this. well done!', '2004-11-30 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039355, 124876, 27850, '<td valign="top">I like the soft lighting and coloring in this shot. Nice framing and off-set position. well done.</td>', 'I like the soft lighting and coloring in this shot. Nice framing and off-set position. well done.', '2004-11-30 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039360, 123451, 27850, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I love the noise in the picture - really adds to the feel.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I love the noise in the picture - really adds to the feel.', '2004-11-30 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039364, 121775, 6667, '<td valign="top">With all the things going for this shot my only complaint is that the pen is plastic instead of the old fashion quill, or better yet, a feather quill! I feel either of those would have dotted the "i"  and fit the theme to a ''"t"!  Still, nicely done.  BOL</td>', 'With all the things going for this shot my only complaint is that the pen is plastic instead of the old fashion quill, or better yet, a feather quill! I feel either of those would have dotted the "i"  and fit the theme to a ''"t"!  Still, nicely done.  BOL', '2004-11-30 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039368, 124863, 27850, '<td valign="top">This is the highest rating i''m giving this challenge. I think you really captured the theme of the challenge. Your picture is beautiful; nice, soft colors, great composition. I actually think the grainy aspect helps impart that "old world" feel. Well done and best of luck - you deserve to ribbon with this!</td>', 'This is the highest rating i''m giving this challenge. I think you really captured the theme of the challenge. Your picture is beautiful; nice, soft colors, great composition. I actually think the grainy aspect helps impart that "old world" feel. Well done and best of luck - you deserve to ribbon with this!', '2004-11-30 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039380, 124319, 28666, '<td valign="top">A perfect picture of low tech, originating back to the beginning...</td>', 'A perfect picture of low tech, originating back to the beginning...', '2004-11-30 23:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039393, 123451, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love the effect here.  Gives that antique feel.</td>', 'I love the effect here.  Gives that antique feel.', '2004-11-30 23:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039394, 122834, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great abstract feel.  Love the lines and colors. Top 2.</td>', 'Great abstract feel.  Love the lines and colors. Top 2.', '2004-11-30 23:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039396, 122990, 25464, '<td valign="top">My top 2.</td>', 'My top 2.', '2004-11-30 23:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039399, 123940, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject.  Fits the challenge perfectly. Very well taken. Top 3.</td>', 'Very interesting subject.  Fits the challenge perfectly. Very well taken. Top 3.', '2004-12-01 00:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039400, 123713, 25464, '<td valign="top">I find this shot appealing but off topic.  Good luck.</td>', 'I find this shot appealing but off topic.  Good luck.', '2004-12-01 00:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039647, 124167, 18838, '<td valign="top">nice oldfashioned atmosphere ... like the diagonal composition, too</td>', 'nice oldfashioned atmosphere ... like the diagonal composition, too', '2004-12-01 01:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039657, 123050, 18838, '<td valign="top">nice composition ... would be nice to see the nose, though ... i don''t really see the connection to ''low tech'' ... 6</td>', 'nice composition ... would be nice to see the nose, though ... i don''t really see the connection to ''low tech'' ... 6', '2004-12-01 01:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039671, 124609, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nothing too interesting in this shot</td>', 'Nothing too interesting in this shot', '2004-12-01 01:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039677, 124697, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not enough space given to the tractor, which I assume is the low tech item. You make the house seem more like the low tech part.</td>', 'Not enough space given to the tractor, which I assume is the low tech item. You make the house seem more like the low tech part.', '2004-12-01 01:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039679, 123241, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not a very pleasing angle, especially wih the huge shadow behind it</td>', 'Not a very pleasing angle, especially wih the huge shadow behind it', '2004-12-01 01:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039681, 124487, 29486, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look tack sharp and when you have just a screw in the picture it better carry it</td>', 'Doesn''t look tack sharp and when you have just a screw in the picture it better carry it', '2004-12-01 01:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039689, 122672, 29486, '<td valign="top">Just seems a little too cluttered</td>', 'Just seems a little too cluttered', '2004-12-01 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
