(1039695, 124949, 29486, '<td valign="top">Looks like a brochure shot from the era. Nothing flashy to get me all hot but a nice photo for sure.</td>', 'Looks like a brochure shot from the era. Nothing flashy to get me all hot but a nice photo for sure.', '2004-12-01 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039702, 122813, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but it''s just a tad too bland for me</td>', 'Nice composition but it''s just a tad too bland for me', '2004-12-01 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039706, 124637, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, colors, etc to highlight a pretty boring item. Good job.</td>', 'Nice angle, colors, etc to highlight a pretty boring item. Good job.', '2004-12-01 01:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039709, 124902, 29486, '<td valign="top">Off topic. I know, I know. You took the risk of the interpretation but I''m going to have to score appropriately</td>', 'Off topic. I know, I know. You took the risk of the interpretation but I''m going to have to score appropriately', '2004-12-01 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039717, 122990, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion and colors. Water pump though?  Wouldn''t that imply that there is something in the ground?  Looks like a weather vane to me. NIce job anyway.</td>', 'Nice compostion and colors. Water pump though?  Wouldn''t that imply that there is something in the ground?  Looks like a weather vane to me. NIce job anyway.', '2004-12-01 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039718, 124280, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too small, can''t see it</td>', 'Too small, can''t see it', '2004-12-01 01:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039727, 124525, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color. A bit blown out in spots. Good job.</td>', 'Nice use of color. A bit blown out in spots. Good job.', '2004-12-01 01:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039730, 123626, 29486, '<td valign="top">Just not appealing to look at</td>', 'Just not appealing to look at', '2004-12-01 01:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039924, 122250, 24982, '<td valign="top">cool effect with the fog</td>', 'cool effect with the fog', '2004-12-01 02:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039983, 124603, 29168, '<td valign="top">Ummm... would that be "electronic" audio? Or just the vocal audio? It''s a neat shot, but the presence of "electronic" causes me to vote much lower since it was so hard to find low-tech without electronic. Or something like that. But is *is* a cool photo!</td>', 'Ummm... would that be "electronic" audio? Or just the vocal audio? It''s a neat shot, but the presence of "electronic" causes me to vote much lower since it was so hard to find low-tech without electronic. Or something like that. But is *is* a cool photo!', '2004-12-01 02:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040094, 124280, 16648, '<td valign="top">too small, hard to tell, but does not appear to be sharply focused.<br/>When you are done editing, resizze to 640 on the long side (or 600 if vertical, like this shot) and then do any sharpening (USM 150%, .3, 7 as a starting point). Ignore DPI. Then when you save it as a JPG use the quality or compression setting to get the file size to 147k or less.</td>', 'too small, hard to tell, but does not appear to be sharply focused.When you are done editing, resizze to 640 on the long side (or 600 if vertical, like this shot) and then do any sharpening (USM 150%, .3, 7 as a starting point). Ignore DPI. Then when you save it as a JPG use the quality or compression setting to get the file size to 147k or less.', '2004-12-01 03:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040098, 124972, 16648, '<td valign="top">The top edge of the knife blade has something going on, some jaggies or over sharpeniing..perticularly noticeable inside the orange pepper. A bit distracting.</td>', 'The top edge of the knife blade has something going on, some jaggies or over sharpeniing..perticularly noticeable inside the orange pepper. A bit distracting.', '2004-12-01 03:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040136, 124751, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I was about to knock you down one point for not cloning some dust out - until I realised it was dust on my own screen! 10.</td>', 'Lovely. I was about to knock you down one point for not cloning some dust out - until I realised it was dust on my own screen! 10.', '2004-12-01 03:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040139, 124959, 29168, '<td valign="top">Out...standing.</td>', 'Out...standing.', '2004-12-01 04:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040141, 124888, 29168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-12-01 04:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040147, 123093, 29168, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2004-12-01 04:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040237, 122672, 29651, '<td valign="top">interesting, indeed.</td>', 'interesting, indeed.', '2004-12-01 06:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040240, 124905, 29651, '<td valign="top">Low tech, but effective.</td>', 'Low tech, but effective.', '2004-12-01 06:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040243, 123008, 29651, '<td valign="top">but, it''s a new invention. I like your color compositions.</td>', 'but, it''s a new invention. I like your color compositions.', '2004-12-01 06:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040249, 124042, 29651, '<td valign="top">as comparing to what? fork and knife? chopstick can''t go high tech. I''ll give you credit for clarity and good composition. if you are saying "Chopsticks" are "low tech", this photo in this catagory is offensive to Asian culture.</td>', 'as comparing to what? fork and knife? chopstick can''t go high tech. I''ll give you credit for clarity and good composition. if you are saying "Chopsticks" are "low tech", this photo in this catagory is offensive to Asian culture.', '2004-12-01 06:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040284, 123940, 24128, '<td valign="top">Great pic and subject, I can''t help feeling that there may be a more dynamic angle/crop possible. Also I think that you would have better image if you had used a polarising filter to avoid the reflections on the glass.</td>', 'Great pic and subject, I can''t help feeling that there may be a more dynamic angle/crop possible. Also I think that you would have better image if you had used a polarising filter to avoid the reflections on the glass.', '2004-12-01 06:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040289, 123008, 24128, '<td valign="top">Good pic, I think that it works better with about 20-30% of the image cropped from the top though</td>', 'Good pic, I think that it works better with about 20-30% of the image cropped from the top though', '2004-12-01 06:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040294, 124776, 24128, '<td valign="top">I love the white-on-white contrasting with the scissors - well done</td>', 'I love the white-on-white contrasting with the scissors - well done', '2004-12-01 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040297, 123093, 24128, '<td valign="top">excellent pic - I have a feeling that I want to see more of it</td>', 'excellent pic - I have a feeling that I want to see more of it', '2004-12-01 06:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040301, 124904, 24128, '<td valign="top">I certainly do remember them :)<br/>I think that this could have been a bit more dynamic if you would have got in closer so that the marks are more defined - great image nonetheless :)</td>', 'I certainly do remember them :)I think that this could have been a bit more dynamic if you would have got in closer so that the marks are more defined - great image nonetheless :)', '2004-12-01 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040306, 124697, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful feeling to this, fantastic contrasts, there is a feeling that it needs to be rotated clockwise just slightly though</td>', 'wonderful feeling to this, fantastic contrasts, there is a feeling that it needs to be rotated clockwise just slightly though', '2004-12-01 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040310, 124621, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice idea, the focus should be on the hub rather than the ground though</td>', 'nice idea, the focus should be on the hub rather than the ground though', '2004-12-01 07:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040311, 124198, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful product shot</td>', 'wonderful product shot', '2004-12-01 07:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
