(1042184, 124506, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very fun to play with! She looks like she''s having fun with it. Low tech in comparsion to the electronic gadgets kids play with nowadays.</td>', 'Very fun to play with! She looks like she''s having fun with it. Low tech in comparsion to the electronic gadgets kids play with nowadays.', '2004-12-01 20:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
