(1042187, 124932, 22479, '<td valign="top">The old shovel is low tech for sure. I think you did a nice job with this photo, but perhaps cropping in on that shovel a bit more would strengthen the validity of this entry. Overall well done.</td>', 'The old shovel is low tech for sure. I think you did a nice job with this photo, but perhaps cropping in on that shovel a bit more would strengthen the validity of this entry. Overall well done.', '2004-12-01 20:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042188, 124973, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. Adequately sharp.</td>', 'Nice exposure. Adequately sharp.', '2004-12-01 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042192, 123656, 22479, '<td valign="top">This image has a certain unprocessed, raw, and edgy look to it. Intentional? I think it works, give the theme.<br/></td>', 'This image has a certain unprocessed, raw, and edgy look to it. Intentional? I think it works, give the theme.', '2004-12-01 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042193, 124464, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice duotone. Everything is focused well, and the exposure is nice. Well done.</td>', 'Nice duotone. Everything is focused well, and the exposure is nice. Well done.', '2004-12-01 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042194, 124202, 22479, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and focused. That''s quite a collection.</td>', 'Well exposed and focused. That''s quite a collection.', '2004-12-01 20:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042196, 124525, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed. Great example of low tech!</td>', 'Nicely framed. Great example of low tech!', '2004-12-01 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042198, 123067, 22479, '<td valign="top">Welcome to Dr. Pain''s clinic. Very dramatic and unique shot. I like it.</td>', 'Welcome to Dr. Pain''s clinic. Very dramatic and unique shot. I like it.', '2004-12-01 20:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042203, 124515, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very well exposed and focused. I think the title is catchy and interesting, though not quite true. Well done.</td>', 'Very well exposed and focused. I think the title is catchy and interesting, though not quite true. Well done.', '2004-12-01 20:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042204, 124697, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. Well composed and executed. Great tonal range. Some loss of details in the shadows on the tractor.</td>', 'Nice scene. Well composed and executed. Great tonal range. Some loss of details in the shadows on the tractor.', '2004-12-01 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042205, 124666, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the funky blue glow. Great use of shadows and lines. Stairs certainly get the job done as they have since their invention who knows how long ago.</td>', 'I like the funky blue glow. Great use of shadows and lines. Stairs certainly get the job done as they have since their invention who knows how long ago.', '2004-12-01 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042208, 124351, 22479, '<td valign="top">Symbolism well conveyed. Great exposure. Nice sharp focus. Has a grainy look to it which may have been an artistic gesture. I like it, and it doesn''t detract from the overall composition. Well done.</td>', 'Symbolism well conveyed. Great exposure. Nice sharp focus. Has a grainy look to it which may have been an artistic gesture. I like it, and it doesn''t detract from the overall composition. Well done.', '2004-12-01 20:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042211, 124893, 22479, '<td valign="top">Well done. Light on child''s face somewhat strong and washes out the details of the cheek. Otherwise exposed well. Nicely focused.</td>', 'Well done. Light on child''s face somewhat strong and washes out the details of the cheek. Otherwise exposed well. Nicely focused.', '2004-12-01 20:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042212, 124984, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, well composed. I like the grainy look.</td>', 'Nice colors, well composed. I like the grainy look.', '2004-12-01 20:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042213, 124394, 22479, '<td valign="top">This has a charming antique look to it. I''d say that the car on the right border takes some of it away, however. Otherwise a nice submission.</td>', 'This has a charming antique look to it. I''d say that the car on the right border takes some of it away, however. Otherwise a nice submission.', '2004-12-01 20:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042216, 124335, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very well exposed. Shap and in focus.</td>', 'Very well exposed. Shap and in focus.', '2004-12-01 20:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042219, 124603, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting! I like the sharpness and detail. This would have been a strong entry in the "Music" challenge. It works well here too.</td>', 'Excellent lighting! I like the sharpness and detail. This would have been a strong entry in the "Music" challenge. It works well here too.', '2004-12-01 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042222, 124707, 22479, '<td valign="top">Some posterization as the tonal range has been narrowed. I like the effect overall. Good example of ''low tech'', by the way.</td>', 'Some posterization as the tonal range has been narrowed. I like the effect overall. Good example of ''low tech'', by the way.', '2004-12-01 21:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042225, 124832, 22479, '<td valign="top">Clever take on the challenge. Well done!</td>', 'Clever take on the challenge. Well done!', '2004-12-01 21:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042231, 124785, 22479, '<td valign="top">Mouse traps get the job done, for sure. I like the perspective and I think it''s well executed. Some loss of focus near the far end of the trap.</td>', 'Mouse traps get the job done, for sure. I like the perspective and I think it''s well executed. Some loss of focus near the far end of the trap.', '2004-12-01 21:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042243, 124351, 26364, '<td valign="top">the white portion of the border is distracting</td>', 'the white portion of the border is distracting', '2004-12-01 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042255, 122990, 22734, '<td valign="top">It is all in the tiltle. lol A very nrat image. 7</td>', 'It is all in the tiltle. lol A very nrat image. 7', '2004-12-01 21:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042268, 123093, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image, however, I question if so much iron emplied makes this a low tech. Regardless your image is stunning. 7</td>', 'A very nice image, however, I question if so much iron emplied makes this a low tech. Regardless your image is stunning. 7', '2004-12-01 21:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042274, 123977, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very low tech.lol 6</td>', 'Very low tech.lol 6', '2004-12-01 21:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042289, 124803, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice authentic litle landmark. I would have cropped tighter on the right right to about 25 percent of the pole to avoid the electric line and the branch as ir detracts.  otherwise a very nice shot. Of course, a real close up of the bell would have made it a stronger contender in my opinion. 6</td>', 'A very nice authentic litle landmark. I would have cropped tighter on the right right to about 25 percent of the pole to avoid the electric line and the branch as ir detracts.  otherwise a very nice shot. Of course, a real close up of the bell would have made it a stronger contender in my opinion. 6', '2004-12-01 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042295, 124665, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very good capture with glowing metal. Very interesting. 7</td>', 'Very good capture with glowing metal. Very interesting. 7', '2004-12-01 21:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042309, 122337, 22734, '<td valign="top">Yes, very low tech and very well capture emanating from darkness. 7</td>', 'Yes, very low tech and very well capture emanating from darkness. 7', '2004-12-01 21:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042318, 124637, 22734, '<td valign="top">Attractive and colorful. 7</td>', 'Attractive and colorful. 7', '2004-12-01 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042334, 124525, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is just wacky and funny. 7</td>', 'This image is just wacky and funny. 7', '2004-12-01 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042346, 124115, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good effort boosted by the hand position to create a pleasant illusion. 7</td>', 'A very good effort boosted by the hand position to create a pleasant illusion. 7', '2004-12-01 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042359, 122882, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. the tones do noy move me, but the composition is strong. 7</td>', 'A very nice image. the tones do noy move me, but the composition is strong. 7', '2004-12-01 21:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042360, 124464, 22734, '<td valign="top">Tes, stone walls are low tech.  7</td>', 'Tes, stone walls are low tech.  7', '2004-12-01 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042364, 122388, 22734, '<td valign="top">Truly low tech and a very well composed diagonal motif. 7</td>', 'Truly low tech and a very well composed diagonal motif. 7', '2004-12-01 21:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042371, 124959, 22734, '<td valign="top">Brooms are ancient and still efficient. 7</td>', 'Brooms are ancient and still efficient. 7', '2004-12-01 21:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042374, 123522, 22734, '<td valign="top">Well, the concept of the well is captured here with a desta that works. 7</td>', 'Well, the concept of the well is captured here with a desta that works. 7', '2004-12-01 21:57:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1042375, 124042, 22734, '<td valign="top">Most ancient and certainly low tech. Once you place them inside the bowl the viewer wants to see each grain. However, I ask too much. A good composition. 7</td>', 'Most ancient and certainly low tech. Once you place them inside the bowl the viewer wants to see each grain. However, I ask too much. A good composition. 7', '2004-12-01 21:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042379, 122250, 22734, '<td valign="top">very low tech and yet incredibly efficient. 7</td>', 'very low tech and yet incredibly efficient. 7', '2004-12-01 22:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042383, 124965, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very moving shot with a sky that adds untold interest. The rigging looks great but the hull could use more definition. Regardless, a good image. 7</td>', 'A very moving shot with a sky that adds untold interest. The rigging looks great but the hull could use more definition. Regardless, a good image. 7', '2004-12-01 22:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042385, 122776, 22734, '<td valign="top">Colors are good and so is the composition. 7</td>', 'Colors are good and so is the composition. 7', '2004-12-01 22:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042391, 124763, 22734, '<td valign="top">To a degree this is low tech but not the manufacture of the utensil. However, I take your represenation more on the old versus the modern in the most abstract realm. 6 Bumping to 7</td>', 'To a degree this is low tech but not the manufacture of the utensil. However, I take your represenation more on the old versus the modern in the most abstract realm. 6 Bumping to 7', '2004-12-01 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042394, 124974, 22734, '<td valign="top">If you were to open this little fellow and study its guts you will be flabergasted at the high tech engineering that inherent in the pocket watch. Low tech it is not, but your image is attractive with good detail.  Bumping to 7 on good presentation.</td>', 'If you were to open this little fellow and study its guts you will be flabergasted at the high tech engineering that inherent in the pocket watch. Low tech it is not, but your image is attractive with good detail.  Bumping to 7 on good presentation.', '2004-12-01 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042397, 121739, 22734, '<td valign="top">Look at this image carefully and ask yourself in what low tech plants were such high tolerences met. Look at the delicasy and the marvel of inserting jewels with measurements that boggle the mind. Old yes, but very far from low tech. However, it is a good capture and I do not want you to go away mad. lol 6 returning for a bump. 7</td>', 'Look at this image carefully and ask yourself in what low tech plants were such high tolerences met. Look at the delicasy and the marvel of inserting jewels with measurements that boggle the mind. Old yes, but very far from low tech. However, it is a good capture and I do not want you to go away mad. lol 6 returning for a bump. 7', '2004-12-01 22:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042399, 124640, 22734, '<td valign="top">Rest assured, this pocket watch as old as it may be is too sophisticated to be labeled low-tech. However, it is well photographed. Bumping to 7</td>', 'Rest assured, this pocket watch as old as it may be is too sophisticated to be labeled low-tech. However, it is well photographed. Bumping to 7', '2004-12-01 22:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042400, 122834, 22734, '<td valign="top">Yes the calculator is modern but these machines are built to uncanny tolerences woth very hi tech production lines. A more suitable entry would have been the abacus. 6</td>', 'Yes the calculator is modern but these machines are built to uncanny tolerences woth very hi tech production lines. A more suitable entry would have been the abacus. 6', '2004-12-01 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042402, 124707, 11756, '<td valign="top">odd composition.  Especially with the edge in the upper left corner.  NOt sure the PS enhances the image either.</td>', 'odd composition.  Especially with the edge in the upper left corner.  NOt sure the PS enhances the image either.', '2004-12-01 22:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042403, 123903, 22734, '<td valign="top">These tools are far from being low tech in that they are made of steel. Yet, your comp is very nice.  Bumping to 6</td>', 'These tools are far from being low tech in that they are made of steel. Yet, your comp is very nice.  Bumping to 6', '2004-12-01 22:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042405, 123756, 11756, '<td valign="top">certainly fits the challenge, though the books are distracting</td>', 'certainly fits the challenge, though the books are distracting', '2004-12-01 22:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042406, 124369, 11756, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem in good focus</td>', 'Doesn''t seem in good focus', '2004-12-01 22:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042407, 124196, 22734, '<td valign="top">Braiding is low tech and an effective way to make rope.</td>', 'Braiding is low tech and an effective way to make rope.', '2004-12-01 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042408, 123484, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice highlighting and emphasis of subject</td>', 'nice highlighting and emphasis of subject', '2004-12-01 22:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
