(1042452, 122600, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very strong image though it seems a bit too dark.</td>', 'Very strong image though it seems a bit too dark.', '2004-12-01 22:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042453, 124959, 22537, '<td valign="top">This looks like the brooms in Fantasia.  Great photo.</td>', 'This looks like the brooms in Fantasia.  Great photo.', '2004-12-01 22:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042454, 122967, 22537, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2004-12-01 22:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042456, 124757, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and angle.</td>', 'Excellent capture and angle.', '2004-12-01 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042457, 123906, 13610, '<td valign="top">isn''t that electronic?</td>', 'isn''t that electronic?', '2004-12-01 22:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042460, 124336, 22537, '<td valign="top">So simple and yet effective.  Great shot.</td>', 'So simple and yet effective.  Great shot.', '2004-12-01 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042465, 124925, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Imaginative.</td>', 'Great shot.  Imaginative.', '2004-12-01 22:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042466, 123688, 22537, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition.</td>', 'I really like the composition.', '2004-12-01 22:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042468, 122330, 22537, '<td valign="top">Rich coloring.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Rich coloring.  Nice shot.', '2004-12-01 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042470, 124524, 22537, '<td valign="top">Ver crisp and clean. Nice work.</td>', 'Ver crisp and clean. Nice work.', '2004-12-01 22:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042471, 124876, 22537, '<td valign="top">I chuckled when I saw this. I can''t help but like it. It must be the simplicity.</td>', 'I chuckled when I saw this. I can''t help but like it. It must be the simplicity.', '2004-12-01 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042474, 124978, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...a view of the power generating facility itself would''ve added some interest for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot...a view of the power generating facility itself would''ve added some interest for the challenge.', '2004-12-01 22:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042478, 124145, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect.', '2004-12-01 22:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042482, 122309, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp image.  I probably wouldn''t have known what it is without the title.  I wonder if it would''ve been used in this painted condition?</td>', 'Nice, sharp image.  I probably wouldn''t have known what it is without the title.  I wonder if it would''ve been used in this painted condition?', '2004-12-01 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042499, 124858, 10818, '<td valign="top">What amazing old equiptment, boxes too....great shot also.</td>', 'What amazing old equiptment, boxes too....great shot also.', '2004-12-01 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042503, 124967, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a great photo and interesting wheel.  Super entry.</td>', 'What a great photo and interesting wheel.  Super entry.', '2004-12-01 23:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042513, 124153, 10818, '<td valign="top">What an awesome old iron/oven.  Great flames and logs, may be cropped just a bit tight though.</td>', 'What an awesome old iron/oven.  Great flames and logs, may be cropped just a bit tight though.', '2004-12-01 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042522, 124525, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent duotone but seems to suffer from compression and many areas are overexposed. Also, it may have been mentioned a million times already (about the toaster being electrical) so I won''t go there.</td>', 'Excellent duotone but seems to suffer from compression and many areas are overexposed. Also, it may have been mentioned a million times already (about the toaster being electrical) so I won''t go there.', '2004-12-01 23:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042549, 124236, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice execution and sharp focus with nice DOF. Just feels a bit dark where it really counts.</td>', 'Nice execution and sharp focus with nice DOF. Just feels a bit dark where it really counts.', '2004-12-01 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042557, 121763, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better without the lens in the background and the string or whatnot is a bit disctracting.</td>', 'I think this would have been better without the lens in the background and the string or whatnot is a bit disctracting.', '2004-12-01 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042562, 124336, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice details of the clothespins but the very bright area under the upper pin seems to draw my eyes away when I know I shouldn''t.</td>', 'Nice details of the clothespins but the very bright area under the upper pin seems to draw my eyes away when I know I shouldn''t.', '2004-12-01 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042609, 124876, 8054, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo for it''s simplicity but the border loses points. In my opinion, it''s way too thick. A simple composition begs for a simple border. 7</td>', 'I really like this photo for it''s simplicity but the border loses points. In my opinion, it''s way too thick. A simple composition begs for a simple border. 7', '2004-12-01 23:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042657, 124751, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful combination of pastel colors, and certainly a low tech implement!  I am wondering if the motion component was even necessary here?  Or maybe done with motion blur instead of stroboscopic motion?  Very nice aesthetics overall.</td>', 'Beautiful combination of pastel colors, and certainly a low tech implement!  I am wondering if the motion component was even necessary here?  Or maybe done with motion blur instead of stroboscopic motion?  Very nice aesthetics overall.', '2004-12-02 00:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042658, 124665, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, and certainly low tech!    A strong contender here.  One thing I think can be improved here is the composition; I think it would be good to crop a bit from the left,  and putting his head around the sweet spot.  Great shot overall.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, and certainly low tech!    A strong contender here.  One thing I think can be improved here is the composition; I think it would be good to crop a bit from the left,  and putting his head around the sweet spot.  Great shot overall.', '2004-12-02 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042660, 123235, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love the angles here and the use of the white background.  Beautiful capture, and certainly low tech!    One of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'I love the angles here and the use of the white background.  Beautiful capture, and certainly low tech!    One of my top picks for the challenge.', '2004-12-02 00:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042664, 123067, 12253, '<td valign="top">I suspect this will be a ribbon winner for it''s great dramatic lighting and good sense of humor.  Good acting.  At least I hope he is acting!  LOL</td>', 'I suspect this will be a ribbon winner for it''s great dramatic lighting and good sense of humor.  Good acting.  At least I hope he is acting!  LOL', '2004-12-02 00:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042669, 122656, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, and I like the composition and angle you chose.  I like the lighting and how it emphasizes and softens her features.  At first it looks like her skin was neat image treated, and too much, but looking closely, I think it''s just right (and probably not neat image)..</td>', 'This was a good idea, and I like the composition and angle you chose.  I like the lighting and how it emphasizes and softens her features.  At first it looks like her skin was neat image treated, and too much, but looking closely, I think it''s just right (and probably not neat image)..', '2004-12-02 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042695, 124757, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, almost makes me feel Im there. From the machinery to the operator to the desk and chair to the room all seems to be natural. Well lit and in good focus. Highlights and shadows are nice and you have set a mood. Even the blown out window does NOT distract my eye from the slight motion of the machinery. Great Job!</td>', 'Very nicely done, almost makes me feel Im there. From the machinery to the operator to the desk and chair to the room all seems to be natural. Well lit and in good focus. Highlights and shadows are nice and you have set a mood. Even the blown out window does NOT distract my eye from the slight motion of the machinery. Great Job!', '2004-12-02 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042701, 122775, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good idea hear but the position of your shot was not well thought out. This picture has the potential of being a great shot but imo has several flaws. 1]. Its to small. You need to use the maximum image allowed for more details. With DPC its 640 X. 2]. I would of tried to get in a position where as the white building behind was not in the picture. It is distracting. 3]. Focus is not sharp but the lighting is ok. Good try and I wish you the best of luck</td>', 'Good idea hear but the position of your shot was not well thought out. This picture has the potential of being a great shot but imo has several flaws. 1]. Its to small. You need to use the maximum image allowed for more details. With DPC its 640 X. 2]. I would of tried to get in a position where as the white building behind was not in the picture. It is distracting. 3]. Focus is not sharp but the lighting is ok. Good try and I wish you the best of luck', '2004-12-02 01:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042707, 124902, 22970, '<td valign="top">Electronic is it part of electricity or is electricity part of electronics. The debate continues but lets look at your photo for a moment. First Im looking at your subject or better said trying to find your subject. There are too much going on here. I dont know if your subject is the power lines, power poll, street lamp, light bulb or the entire photograph. The subject is just not interesting. Composition, when you cropped your photograph you went off the canvas a little to the top right leaving a white area in space that is distracting. Lighting is ok and the sky has a nice blue tone. Im sorry, I mean no disrespect but I have to comment on the way I see the photograph for your good and mine. Keep up the work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Electronic is it part of electricity or is electricity part of electronics. The debate continues but lets look at your photo for a moment. First Im looking at your subject or better said trying to find your subject. There are too much going on here. I dont know if your subject is the power lines, power poll, street lamp, light bulb or the entire photograph. The subject is just not interesting. Composition, when you cropped your photograph you went off the canvas a little to the top right leaving a white area in space that is distracting. Lighting is ok and the sky has a nice blue tone. Im sorry, I mean no disrespect but I have to comment on the way I see the photograph for your good and mine. Keep up the work and good luck in the challenge.', '2004-12-02 01:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042713, 123906, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice work. The overall photograph does not override the subject. The subject has highlights and shadows drawing my eye to it. I think the B&amp;W effect worked well with this photograph. I like the composition and lighting. Focus seems to be good. Good Job!</td>', 'Nice work. The overall photograph does not override the subject. The subject has highlights and shadows drawing my eye to it. I think the B&W effect worked well with this photograph. I like the composition and lighting. Focus seems to be good. Good Job!', '2004-12-02 01:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042730, 124865, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors. Great idea. The the nuts moving off the botton of the frame and the angle of the picture make it seem as though the image is tipping forward. I would change one of those two ekements. Alone they work; in tandem, they unbalance this image.</td>', 'Stunning colors. Great idea. The the nuts moving off the botton of the frame and the angle of the picture make it seem as though the image is tipping forward. I would change one of those two ekements. Alone they work; in tandem, they unbalance this image.', '2004-12-02 02:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042731, 124236, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative and captivating. Nice job.</td>', 'Creative and captivating. Nice job.', '2004-12-02 02:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042733, 122545, 22384, '<td valign="top">The harsh light and shadows are distracting to me. Interesting use of motif in the bristles, and interesting angle.</td>', 'The harsh light and shadows are distracting to me. Interesting use of motif in the bristles, and interesting angle.', '2004-12-02 02:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042734, 124369, 22384, '<td valign="top">Pleasant and strangely peaceful image. Nice.</td>', 'Pleasant and strangely peaceful image. Nice.', '2004-12-02 02:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042735, 124640, 22384, '<td valign="top">Elegant in composition, line, clarity, simplicity, understated use of light and shadow, and stunning use of color. This looks like a glossy, upscale ad. Flawless piece.</td>', 'Elegant in composition, line, clarity, simplicity, understated use of light and shadow, and stunning use of color. This looks like a glossy, upscale ad. Flawless piece.', '2004-12-02 02:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042738, 124524, 22384, '<td valign="top">Sleek and classy. Sharp and glossy. If I could see just a bit more of the base, perhaps a subtle, slim glimpse of glossy black, this would almost come to life. Wow! High impact photo.</td>', 'Sleek and classy. Sharp and glossy. If I could see just a bit more of the base, perhaps a subtle, slim glimpse of glossy black, this would almost come to life. Wow! High impact photo.', '2004-12-02 02:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042739, 121778, 22384, '<td valign="top">Another stunner. This would be a ten if the flame weren''t skewed by the refraction of the glass. Great balance of light and shadow, line and curve. Sweet image.</td>', 'Another stunner. This would be a ten if the flame weren''t skewed by the refraction of the glass. Great balance of light and shadow, line and curve. Sweet image.', '2004-12-02 02:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042742, 124788, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image is a little too sparsely framed (having both object run off the image at opposite ends, splits your image and your viewer''s focus.) and a lot too white for my tastes. Nice concept, though. Perhaps a different color background, more of the screwdriver handle, or a tighter focus on the screwdriver handle would make the difference.</td>', 'This image is a little too sparsely framed (having both object run off the image at opposite ends, splits your image and your viewer''s focus.) and a lot too white for my tastes. Nice concept, though. Perhaps a different color background, more of the screwdriver handle, or a tighter focus on the screwdriver handle would make the difference.', '2004-12-02 02:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042744, 122267, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great smoky greyscale (with maybe a subtle hint of sepia). The angle is a little too skewed for such a mathematical/machine image. I would come a bit more straight on from the front of the side.</td>', 'Great smoky greyscale (with maybe a subtle hint of sepia). The angle is a little too skewed for such a mathematical/machine image. I would come a bit more straight on from the front of the side.', '2004-12-02 02:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042747, 122776, 22384, '<td valign="top">Fascinating use of color. The framing and the weathervane direction make it seem as though this image were reversed.</td>', 'Fascinating use of color. The framing and the weathervane direction make it seem as though this image were reversed.', '2004-12-02 02:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042752, 123977, 24128, '<td valign="top">great idea, I know that it might be a little difficult to do but it would be really good if you could get some light from beneath (possibly using a large sheet of white paper as a sunlight reflector), I think that this would give the plane a really dynamic feeling.</td>', 'great idea, I know that it might be a little difficult to do but it would be really good if you could get some light from beneath (possibly using a large sheet of white paper as a sunlight reflector), I think that this would give the plane a really dynamic feeling.', '2004-12-02 02:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042764, 124493, 24128, '<td valign="top">I feel that the items on the left look a little too over exposed and harsh, thus they are a little distracting. Also, I find the border looks a little ''cheap'' and devalues the image somewhat.  All in all it''s still a very good image - well done :)</td>', 'I feel that the items on the left look a little too over exposed and harsh, thus they are a little distracting. Also, I find the border looks a little ''cheap'' and devalues the image somewhat.  All in all it''s still a very good image - well done :)', '2004-12-02 03:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042766, 124819, 24128, '<td valign="top">great focus and perfect dof, the border seems just a little too ''heavy'' though</td>', 'great focus and perfect dof, the border seems just a little too ''heavy'' though', '2004-12-02 03:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042768, 123067, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful emotion, maybe just slightly too dark, I feel that I''m looking for more detail that could have been included with just a little more light - great image, well done</td>', 'wonderful emotion, maybe just slightly too dark, I feel that I''m looking for more detail that could have been included with just a little more light - great image, well done', '2004-12-02 03:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042769, 121834, 24128, '<td valign="top">good pic but the focus seems to be on the ground rather than on the wheel</td>', 'good pic but the focus seems to be on the ground rather than on the wheel', '2004-12-02 03:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042774, 123085, 24128, '<td valign="top">I feel that this really could do with a much deeper dof, the focal plane is on the edge of the box and thus the warning becomes the prominent item in the image. Additionally a slight clockwise rotation would help.</td>', 'I feel that this really could do with a much deeper dof, the focal plane is on the edge of the box and thus the warning becomes the prominent item in the image. Additionally a slight clockwise rotation would help.', '2004-12-02 03:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042809, 123975, 22479, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of reflections. My suggestion is to increase the image size in your future submissions for greater visual impact. Try to keep it between 600-640 pixels on the long edge.</td>', 'Interesting use of reflections. My suggestion is to increase the image size in your future submissions for greater visual impact. Try to keep it between 600-640 pixels on the long edge.', '2004-12-02 04:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042810, 124890, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of low tech. I especially like the fact that this scale is off by 2/10th of a kg. Very nice touch, although I doubt a lot of voters will miss this subtle yet effective point.</td>', 'This is a great example of low tech. I especially like the fact that this scale is off by 2/10th of a kg. Very nice touch, although I doubt a lot of voters will miss this subtle yet effective point.', '2004-12-02 04:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
