(1042826, 124905, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good perspective. Certainly low tech. some loss of focus at the far end but overall well shot with good exposure and focus.</td>', 'Good perspective. Certainly low tech. some loss of focus at the far end but overall well shot with good exposure and focus.', '2004-12-02 04:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
