(1043048, 123977, 25017, '<td valign="top">I love this concept but something missing wish the plane was lighter but great try</td>', 'I love this concept but something missing wish the plane was lighter but great try', '2004-12-02 10:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043050, 123029, 8054, '<td valign="top">Ahh yes...negatives and contact sheets...those were the days! Excellent composition and color. Contrast is also excellent. Nice touch with DOF. 10</td>', 'Ahh yes...negatives and contact sheets...those were the days! Excellent composition and color. Contrast is also excellent. Nice touch with DOF. 10', '2004-12-02 10:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043056, 124701, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been perfect if there were more details of the typewriter and less of the table ledge on the right. I love the lighting although it is a bit bright (sharp shadows on the bottom).</td>', 'I think this would have been perfect if there were more details of the typewriter and less of the table ledge on the right. I love the lighting although it is a bit bright (sharp shadows on the bottom).', '2004-12-02 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043061, 124145, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very good job with the spotlight and floating casette tape. Although I feel it has a bit too much negative space along the top, I can see this placing very high perhaps a top three finish. Good luck! 9</td>', 'Very good job with the spotlight and floating casette tape. Although I feel it has a bit too much negative space along the top, I can see this placing very high perhaps a top three finish. Good luck! 9', '2004-12-02 10:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043070, 124145, 29020, '<td valign="top">Really nice! Maybe the cassette could have been more in the centre of the light, but i''m not sure that''s necessary.</td>', 'Really nice! Maybe the cassette could have been more in the centre of the light, but i''m not sure that''s necessary.', '2004-12-02 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043290, 122250, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition. Love the "ghost" effect. Good luck with this top contender.</td>', 'Very strong composition. Love the "ghost" effect. Good luck with this top contender.', '2004-12-02 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043412, 124883, 30195, '<td valign="top">Awesome Picture</td>', 'Awesome Picture', '2004-12-02 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043464, 124292, 29269, '<td valign="top">Maybe it would have improved the photo if you had someone move the balls on the abacus as opposed to having them perfectly still and in order?</td>', 'Maybe it would have improved the photo if you had someone move the balls on the abacus as opposed to having them perfectly still and in order?', '2004-12-02 14:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043479, 124260, 6999, '<td valign="top">Man, but this is a small photo. That has the advantage at least of allowing the strong general lines of the composition to show through - and those lines are strong indeed; but what''s missing is the details. A photo should work on both levels, ideally - that sense of a grand design, and of the fascination and interest of details, and your submitted size orevents that I''m afraid.</td>', 'Man, but this is a small photo. That has the advantage at least of allowing the strong general lines of the composition to show through - and those lines are strong indeed; but what''s missing is the details. A photo should work on both levels, ideally - that sense of a grand design, and of the fascination and interest of details, and your submitted size orevents that I''m afraid.', '2004-12-02 14:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043723, 122967, 29269, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred more focused writing (lines) on the paper.</td>', 'I would have preferred more focused writing (lines) on the paper.', '2004-12-02 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043786, 122330, 27763, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the old metal.  The way you cropped this makes it very interesting to look at.  My only nitpick is that I might have cropped a little bit more off of the top.  But this is a nice shot.</td>', 'I love the texture of the old metal.  The way you cropped this makes it very interesting to look at.  My only nitpick is that I might have cropped a little bit more off of the top.  But this is a nice shot.', '2004-12-02 18:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043795, 124888, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition.  I love the low angle and the way that you included the foreground.  Very nice lighting, too.  This is by far my favorite (of many!) wagon wheel type shots in this challenge.  8.</td>', 'This is a great composition.  I love the low angle and the way that you included the foreground.  Very nice lighting, too.  This is by far my favorite (of many!) wagon wheel type shots in this challenge.  8.', '2004-12-02 18:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043797, 122959, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines, or thumbs, to point the viewers eyes to the blade and pencil. The duotone is also a good choice. Focus is sharp. Although there is one issue I have with this and it''s the light spot by the person''s left hand. At first I thought it was my monitor but then I scrolled the web page and it lies within the photo. It looks like you dodged that area specifically and unfortunately, it loses lot of points. Other than that, it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines, or thumbs, to point the viewers eyes to the blade and pencil. The duotone is also a good choice. Focus is sharp. Although there is one issue I have with this and it''s the light spot by the person''s left hand. At first I thought it was my monitor but then I scrolled the web page and it lies within the photo. It looks like you dodged that area specifically and unfortunately, it loses lot of points. Other than that, it''s a very nice shot.', '2004-12-02 18:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043800, 122672, 27763, '<td valign="top">nicely composed.</td>', 'nicely composed.', '2004-12-02 18:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043802, 124042, 27763, '<td valign="top">nice composition.</td>', 'nice composition.', '2004-12-02 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043805, 124970, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting view that makes this shot stand out from many of the other typewriter photos in this challenge.  The paper is a nice touch.</td>', 'This is an interesting view that makes this shot stand out from many of the other typewriter photos in this challenge.  The paper is a nice touch.', '2004-12-02 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
