(1044243, 122250, 22537, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot is surreal.  The fog adds a real mystique.  Good luck.</td>', 'Something about this shot is surreal.  The fog adds a real mystique.  Good luck.', '2004-12-03 00:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
