(1044305, 124865, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think the nuts on the table look too organised - perhaps it would look better if they were scattered about. Nice woody/nutty tones, but background shadow is uneven.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-07 04:04:40.</i></td>', 'I think the nuts on the table look too organised - perhaps it would look better if they were scattered about. Nice woody/nutty tones, but background shadow is uneven.', '2004-12-03 02:50:16.000000', '2004-12-07 04:04:40.000000', 1),
(1044359, 122505, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2004-12-03 04:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044444, 124893, 27763, '<td valign="top">cute kid!  i think i would have liked this better if it was taken from a different angle.  maybe if you had crouched down so that it was closer to "eye level" with the boy.  i think that photos of children, when taken from standing height, looking down on the children, can tend to look "snapshotty".  not always, though.  just my opinion.</td>', 'cute kid!  i think i would have liked this better if it was taken from a different angle.  maybe if you had crouched down so that it was closer to "eye level" with the boy.  i think that photos of children, when taken from standing height, looking down on the children, can tend to look "snapshotty".  not always, though.  just my opinion.', '2004-12-03 08:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044451, 123681, 27763, '<td valign="top">great examples of low tech, but this has a cluttered feel to me.  also, the lighting is not very interesting.  the foreground looks \"flat\", with no depth. however, i do respect the fact that this photo is pretty original in a way. 5.</td>', 'great examples of low tech, but this has a cluttered feel to me.  also, the lighting is not very interesting.  the foreground looks \"flat\", with no depth. however, i do respect the fact that this photo is pretty original in a way. 5.', '2004-12-03 08:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044459, 123085, 27763, '<td valign="top">i like the shallow DOF.  good use of a black background with no shadows, etc. good focus, color, sharpness.</td>', 'i like the shallow DOF.  good use of a black background with no shadows, etc. good focus, color, sharpness.', '2004-12-03 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044518, 124926, 26364, '<td valign="top">a fill in flash might have helped detail the rings better</td>', 'a fill in flash might have helped detail the rings better', '2004-12-03 10:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044520, 124972, 26364, '<td valign="top">i really like the colors</td>', 'i really like the colors', '2004-12-03 10:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044564, 124965, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  While I sort of like the soft pastel look here, it seems to me this is "underprocessed"; it might be improved by using USM to sharpen it a bit, upping the saturation slightly, applying levels or boosting contrast a bit, and possibly cropping to get the boat out of horizontal center.  Where to crop is a little issue: it wold be nice to have only this boat in the shot, but  to get rid of the tug would require cropping too tightly on the tall ship.  Still, this is advanced editing, and a crop with a little "removal" might have been a good idea.  Or more simply, you could try cropping on the left.  After the challenge, if you want, I''d be happy to help you play with this a bit.</td>', 'Nice idea.  While I sort of like the soft pastel look here, it seems to me this is "underprocessed"; it might be improved by using USM to sharpen it a bit, upping the saturation slightly, applying levels or boosting contrast a bit, and possibly cropping to get the boat out of horizontal center.  Where to crop is a little issue: it wold be nice to have only this boat in the shot, but  to get rid of the tug would require cropping too tightly on the tall ship.  Still, this is advanced editing, and a crop with a little "removal" might have been a good idea.  Or more simply, you could try cropping on the left.  After the challenge, if you want, I''d be happy to help you play with this a bit.', '2004-12-03 11:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044575, 123975, 12253, '<td valign="top">Too smal for technical evall, and I am not sure what this has to do with low tech.  I''m sure you have some low tech concept that this is following, but the message (challenge theme) has to be somewhat apparent to the viewer!</td>', 'Too smal for technical evall, and I am not sure what this has to do with low tech.  I''m sure you have some low tech concept that this is following, but the message (challenge theme) has to be somewhat apparent to the viewer!', '2004-12-03 11:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044580, 124196, 12253, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what this has to do with low tech.  I''m sure you have some low tech concept that this is following, but the message (challenge theme) has to be somewhat apparent to the viewer!  Also, this appears to be oversharpened, and unevenly exposed/leveled.  With regard to the latter, I think it would have been better to crop the bottom out and stick to the contrasty region which is more appealing.</td>', 'I am not sure what this has to do with low tech.  I''m sure you have some low tech concept that this is following, but the message (challenge theme) has to be somewhat apparent to the viewer!  Also, this appears to be oversharpened, and unevenly exposed/leveled.  With regard to the latter, I think it would have been better to crop the bottom out and stick to the contrasty region which is more appealing.', '2004-12-03 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044584, 124260, 12253, '<td valign="top">Too smal for technical eval.  Please try to come close to the already-too-small 640 pixel limit!  Topic is right on though.</td>', 'Too smal for technical eval.  Please try to come close to the already-too-small 640 pixel limit!  Topic is right on though.', '2004-12-03 11:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
