(1044604, 122990, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice lighting and sharpness.  Might be interesting to shoot a closup of just the windmill wheel itself as a geometric abstract.</td>', 'Good composition, nice lighting and sharpness.  Might be interesting to shoot a closup of just the windmill wheel itself as a geometric abstract.', '2004-12-03 11:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044615, 124853, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for low tech.  Overall, this is well done, but to me seems done in a rather "sterile" studio manner; it might have been nice to do this on a desk, with candlelight, etc. to add atmosphere.</td>', 'Nice idea for low tech.  Overall, this is well done, but to me seems done in a rather "sterile" studio manner; it might have been nice to do this on a desk, with candlelight, etc. to add atmosphere.', '2004-12-03 12:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044724, 124842, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  IMHO focus should be on items being crushed, seems a bit soft.  I like the comp.  Lighting, however, seems a bif flat, and perhaps the skin was treated with neatimageo or it''s a closup issue because the hand eems a bit plastic.</td>', 'Good idea!  IMHO focus should be on items being crushed, seems a bit soft.  I like the comp.  Lighting, however, seems a bif flat, and perhaps the skin was treated with neatimageo or it''s a closup issue because the hand eems a bit plastic.', '2004-12-03 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044726, 122959, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea and very good composition.  It would have been nice, IMHO, to get a little more (soft) light on the knife.</td>', 'Good idea and very good composition.  It would have been nice, IMHO, to get a little more (soft) light on the knife.', '2004-12-03 13:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044727, 122337, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea and interesting angle.  On the critical side, the bright spot is a bit distracting, as is  the dark part on the end of the handle (drop off is so "abrupt").</td>', 'Good idea and interesting angle.  On the critical side, the bright spot is a bit distracting, as is  the dark part on the end of the handle (drop off is so "abrupt").', '2004-12-03 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044729, 124603, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, though I would not consider a wireless mike to be low tech (nor non-electronic as the chalenge called for!)  I like the composition (negative space) but the crop on the singer seems to "in-between" for me (not a severe, intentional crop, nor a minor, non-crop).  Or something like that ;)</td>', 'Interesting shot, though I would not consider a wireless mike to be low tech (nor non-electronic as the chalenge called for!)  I like the composition (negative space) but the crop on the singer seems to "in-between" for me (not a severe, intentional crop, nor a minor, non-crop).  Or something like that ;)', '2004-12-03 13:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044772, 124865, 27763, '<td valign="top">mmmmm...... nuts.   nice lighting.  I know that as a rule of thumb a photo usually looks better when the subject is off center, but in this case i think a centered subject may be best. but, then again, what do i know?  just my opinion.</td>', 'mmmmm...... nuts.   nice lighting.  I know that as a rule of thumb a photo usually looks better when the subject is off center, but in this case i think a centered subject may be best. but, then again, what do i know?  just my opinion.', '2004-12-03 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
