(1044871, 124905, 29486, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, nice idea. The angle though is wrong. If this in fact were a rat (mouse) looking at it, he would have a real sore head by now because he is much taller than the hole. Not being a rat, maybe this doesn''t actually make sense but a little lower angle might have been more realistic?</td>', 'Good clarity, nice idea. The angle though is wrong. If this in fact were a rat (mouse) looking at it, he would have a real sore head by now because he is much taller than the hole. Not being a rat, maybe this doesn''t actually make sense but a little lower angle might have been more realistic?', '2004-12-03 15:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044872, 123975, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too small of a photo. If the mirror is the low tech item, I think you could have picked a better way to illustrate it.</td>', 'Too small of a photo. If the mirror is the low tech item, I think you could have picked a better way to illustrate it.', '2004-12-03 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
