(1047810, 123713, 28742, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah - "Electric" Guitars have been obsolete since the appearance of the new plasma driven, stringless guitars with embedded nanotechnology.  :-)  Nice pic, but hardly low tech. Sorry.</td>', 'Oh yeah - "Electric" Guitars have been obsolete since the appearance of the new plasma driven, stringless guitars with embedded nanotechnology.  :-)  Nice pic, but hardly low tech. Sorry.', '2004-12-05 22:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047815, 124701, 28742, '<td valign="top">Third typewriter I''ve seen &amp; almost the best, but the lighting could be just a little softer and seems like it would be better on a solid colored surface - the wood color just overpowers the photo. Also would like to see paper in it and, if done properly, typing hands could help.  Good job overall though!</td>', 'Third typewriter I''ve seen & almost the best, but the lighting could be just a little softer and seems like it would be better on a solid colored surface - the wood color just overpowers the photo. Also would like to see paper in it and, if done properly, typing hands could help.  Good job overall though!', '2004-12-05 22:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047818, 122472, 28742, '<td valign="top">interesting, but over blown white.</td>', 'interesting, but over blown white.', '2004-12-05 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047823, 124371, 28742, '<td valign="top">More llike loosening the axle on Alfalfa''s wagon so he can have Darla all to himself!  ;-)  Very nice pic. I like the selective desat, the cropping, the subject. One minor flaw might be the bill of the ball cap makes a white line that follows the line of the boy''s neck and makes the boy''s image look comp''d in. A better title would help the Challenge subject also - i.e. "Life before Game Boy" or something like that. ;-) Definitely a top pick for me though!</td>', 'More llike loosening the axle on Alfalfa''s wagon so he can have Darla all to himself!  ;-)  Very nice pic. I like the selective desat, the cropping, the subject. One minor flaw might be the bill of the ball cap makes a white line that follows the line of the boy''s neck and makes the boy''s image look comp''d in. A better title would help the Challenge subject also - i.e. "Life before Game Boy" or something like that. ;-) Definitely a top pick for me though!', '2004-12-05 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047830, 123522, 28742, '<td valign="top">A point or two off cuz it''s leaning over - I would guess you couldn''t do anything about that although the pump does not look like it is secured there. Could''ve been a top pick for me but for that.</td>', 'A point or two off cuz it''s leaning over - I would guess you couldn''t do anything about that although the pump does not look like it is secured there. Could''ve been a top pick for me but for that.', '2004-12-05 23:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047836, 124335, 28742, '<td valign="top">Too much explanation in the title, but I understand you have to get people to get it. Maybe it just sounds too redundant. I think simply "DNA replaces fingerprints" = maybe not technically accurate, but people would get it.<br/>Regarding the pic - this concept should been played out in a crime scene type of staging. This lookes like a giant fingerprint patterned shower curtain.</td>', 'Too much explanation in the title, but I understand you have to get people to get it. Maybe it just sounds too redundant. I think simply "DNA replaces fingerprints" = maybe not technically accurate, but people would get it.Regarding the pic - this concept should been played out in a crime scene type of staging. This lookes like a giant fingerprint patterned shower curtain.', '2004-12-05 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
