(1047861, 121877, 18799, '<td valign="top">This was the first thing that came to my mind when I saw the challenge.   I didn''t enter it.  This is a very nice image, I like the diagonal of the grinding piece but wonder if it would have been more effective leading from upper left to lower right.  The only reason I say this is that most commercial compositons take advantage of that because it''s the way people view images - left to right.  Not a big deal, just an observation.   In any event, 8</td>', 'This was the first thing that came to my mind when I saw the challenge.   I didn''t enter it.  This is a very nice image, I like the diagonal of the grinding piece but wonder if it would have been more effective leading from upper left to lower right.  The only reason I say this is that most commercial compositons take advantage of that because it''s the way people view images - left to right.  Not a big deal, just an observation.   In any event, 8', '2004-12-05 23:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047862, 124701, 18799, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, great title.  7</td>', 'Fits the challenge, great title.  7', '2004-12-05 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
