(1047869, 123794, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the humor in this image.  I think the composition is a little centered, and would have more impact if you had cropped some off the right side.  Still good though  7</td>', 'I like the humor in this image.  I think the composition is a little centered, and would have more impact if you had cropped some off the right side.  Still good though  7', '2004-12-05 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047870, 121816, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why the watch wasn''t open.  I think I would have liked it better if it was.   6</td>', 'I''m wondering why the watch wasn''t open.  I think I would have liked it better if it was.   6', '2004-12-05 23:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047871, 124926, 28742, '<td valign="top">Extra point for not spelling it the French way!  I think they spell it "dix vitesse" (Ten Speed)  ;-)</td>', 'Extra point for not spelling it the French way!  I think they spell it "dix vitesse" (Ten Speed)  ;-)', '2004-12-05 23:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047875, 123240, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very nice image  6</td>', 'Very nice image  6', '2004-12-05 23:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047877, 124145, 28742, '<td valign="top">Awesome awesome awesome. A see-through 8-track would''ve been cooler, but the quality and impact of the image make this shot!</td>', 'Awesome awesome awesome. A see-through 8-track would''ve been cooler, but the quality and impact of the image make this shot!', '2004-12-05 23:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047878, 122505, 18799, '<td valign="top">Your image certainly fits the challenge, but it doesn''t do anything for me interest wise.   I think because all the lines are vertical and all carry the same weight - my eyes are not really led into the photo, and really don''t have much reason to stay there long.  I would suggest being more creative in the angles or perspective that you choose.  Try to show these common object in a not so common way.   5</td>', 'Your image certainly fits the challenge, but it doesn''t do anything for me interest wise.   I think because all the lines are vertical and all carry the same weight - my eyes are not really led into the photo, and really don''t have much reason to stay there long.  I would suggest being more creative in the angles or perspective that you choose.  Try to show these common object in a not so common way.   5', '2004-12-05 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047880, 123626, 28742, '<td valign="top">toothpaste? low tech? Hmmm. <br/></td>', 'toothpaste? low tech? Hmmm. ', '2004-12-05 23:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047883, 124493, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think there are too many objects in this image.   5</td>', 'I think there are too many objects in this image.   5', '2004-12-05 23:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047884, 123681, 28742, '<td valign="top">Should''ve left the knife red or used a different brand. Other than that I like the items chosen, but composition has a big hole in the center that seemd out of place.</td>', 'Should''ve left the knife red or used a different brand. Other than that I like the items chosen, but composition has a big hole in the center that seemd out of place.', '2004-12-05 23:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047888, 124973, 28742, '<td valign="top">Good concept, nice shot except for the tape(?) streaming off to the left - can''t tell what that is. If it was tape off the roll, should be sliver side up. If it''s not tape, it''s distracting. Hope this helps. :-)</td>', 'Good concept, nice shot except for the tape(?) streaming off to the left - can''t tell what that is. If it was tape off the roll, should be sliver side up. If it''s not tape, it''s distracting. Hope this helps. :-)', '2004-12-05 23:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047889, 124515, 18799, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I look at this image and think "so what, it''s an opener".  I don''t mean to be negative.   I think for an object such as this to work, you will have to come up with some creative way of presenting it.   <br/></td>', 'To be honest, I look at this image and think "so what, it''s an opener".  I don''t mean to be negative.   I think for an object such as this to work, you will have to come up with some creative way of presenting it.   ', '2004-12-05 23:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047891, 124042, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice image - good everything, technically. For me, low tech represents technology that has been replaced and obsoleted - chopsticks are old, but still very much in use. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Nice image - good everything, technically. For me, low tech represents technology that has been replaced and obsoleted - chopsticks are old, but still very much in use. Hope this is helpful.', '2004-12-05 23:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047892, 123940, 28742, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! Now if it was only shot outside in the sunlight! ;-) A top pick for me and surely a top finisher.</td>', 'Outstanding! Now if it was only shot outside in the sunlight! ;-) A top pick for me and surely a top finisher.', '2004-12-05 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047900, 124148, 18799, '<td valign="top">The only problem I have here is relating your title to the image.  I would expect to see a wheelbarrow.  As for the image itself, I would have liked to see the center of interest in the compostion, the hub, bolt, and nut, move off center a little more.  6</td>', 'The only problem I have here is relating your title to the image.  I would expect to see a wheelbarrow.  As for the image itself, I would have liked to see the center of interest in the compostion, the hub, bolt, and nut, move off center a little more.  6', '2004-12-05 23:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047902, 124757, 28742, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t pick on the photo (too good to criticize), but the title... How about: "They don''t make ''em like this anymore" or "She can still keep up with the best of ''em!" - Outstanding job!</td>', 'I couldn''t pick on the photo (too good to criticize), but the title... How about: "They don''t make ''em like this anymore" or "She can still keep up with the best of ''em!" - Outstanding job!', '2004-12-05 23:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047903, 123975, 18799, '<td valign="top">This image is really small</td>', 'This image is really small', '2004-12-05 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047905, 123067, 28742, '<td valign="top">Disturbing. Interesting.  ...but disturbing.  ;-)</td>', 'Disturbing. Interesting.  ...but disturbing.  ;-)', '2004-12-05 23:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047909, 124925, 28742, '<td valign="top">Title makes the shot for this challenge! Pretty good!</td>', 'Title makes the shot for this challenge! Pretty good!', '2004-12-05 23:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047913, 123681, 18799, '<td valign="top">I can see all this object could be considered low teck, and all relate to a theme - hiking or camping but the compostion is a little uninteresting.  I think a more creative layout of these objects could have made for a more interesting photograph.</td>', 'I can see all this object could be considered low teck, and all relate to a theme - hiking or camping but the compostion is a little uninteresting.  I think a more creative layout of these objects could have made for a more interesting photograph.', '2004-12-05 23:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047915, 124776, 28742, '<td valign="top">Dude - don''t you know you can get these new, computer driven cutting machines that make these perfect little paper snowflakes??  ...oh wait, yeah ok I get it. Good job! ;-)</td>', 'Dude - don''t you know you can get these new, computer driven cutting machines that make these perfect little paper snowflakes??  ...oh wait, yeah ok I get it. Good job! ;-)', '2004-12-05 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047917, 123067, 18799, '<td valign="top">This looks like something from a horror movie!.   I think there are some interesting objects but don''t care for the single source lighing that doesn''t let me see any of the side of this (victim''s) face.  Still, for interest and being very close, a 6</td>', 'This looks like something from a horror movie!.   I think there are some interesting objects but don''t care for the single source lighing that doesn''t let me see any of the side of this (victim''s) face.  Still, for interest and being very close, a 6', '2004-12-05 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047924, 121775, 28742, '<td valign="top">If only Thomas Jefferson had such colorful ink! ;-) Nicely done - the candle flame is a little unecessarily distracting though.</td>', 'If only Thomas Jefferson had such colorful ink! ;-) Nicely done - the candle flame is a little unecessarily distracting though.', '2004-12-05 23:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047926, 123357, 28742, '<td valign="top">Where''s the "machine" ?  ;-) Shadow is a little harsh on the spool.</td>', 'Where''s the "machine" ?  ;-) Shadow is a little harsh on the spool.', '2004-12-05 23:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047929, 122882, 28742, '<td valign="top">like the photo with the exception of the yellow color effect. Could''ve been better with BW or even color.</td>', 'like the photo with the exception of the yellow color effect. Could''ve been better with BW or even color.', '2004-12-05 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047935, 124984, 28742, '<td valign="top">"Low Score"  ;-) Clever and an otherwise good shot, but...</td>', '"Low Score"  ;-) Clever and an otherwise good shot, but...', '2004-12-05 23:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047942, 122813, 28742, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, but doesn''t fit my idea of low tech. It may be old, but barbed wire is still in use everywhere. Still, I can''t give it a really low score.  ;-)</td>', 'Really nice image, but doesn''t fit my idea of low tech. It may be old, but barbed wire is still in use everywhere. Still, I can''t give it a really low score.  ;-)', '2004-12-06 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047951, 124983, 28742, '<td valign="top">Cropped just a little too tight - makes an otherwise easily recognizable object hard to figure out.</td>', 'Cropped just a little too tight - makes an otherwise easily recognizable object hard to figure out.', '2004-12-06 00:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047952, 124904, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... No. No, I don''t.  ;-)</td>', 'Hmmm... No. No, I don''t.  ;-)', '2004-12-06 00:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047955, 123484, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very well done!</td>', 'Very well done!', '2004-12-06 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047957, 122967, 28742, '<td valign="top">An obvious choice for the challenge yet the first one I''ve seen.</td>', 'An obvious choice for the challenge yet the first one I''ve seen.', '2004-12-06 00:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047965, 124054, 28742, '<td valign="top">String, where''s the string??  ;-)  Seems to me this concept requires both parties and the string. Well, at least the string. Nicely shot though.</td>', 'String, where''s the string??  ;-)  Seems to me this concept requires both parties and the string. Well, at least the string. Nicely shot though.', '2004-12-06 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047971, 123777, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, much cleaner than the last one I saw.  ;-)  Nicely done. No complaints or criticisms.</td>', 'Ahhh, much cleaner than the last one I saw.  ;-)  Nicely done. No complaints or criticisms.', '2004-12-06 00:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047979, 122250, 28742, '<td valign="top">If only you''d have cropped it on the bottom above the waterline, you''d have had me convinced!</td>', 'If only you''d have cropped it on the bottom above the waterline, you''d have had me convinced!', '2004-12-06 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047987, 124842, 28742, '<td valign="top">Some actual crushed (whatever they are) would''ve helped this look less staged. Decent entry though.</td>', 'Some actual crushed (whatever they are) would''ve helped this look less staged. Decent entry though.', '2004-12-06 00:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1047993, 123732, 28742, '<td valign="top">Do it again - but not on a woodgrain surface - and I''ll give it an 8 or 9.  ;-)</td>', 'Do it again - but not on a woodgrain surface - and I''ll give it an 8 or 9.  ;-)', '2004-12-06 00:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048002, 124785, 28742, '<td valign="top">May be low tech, but has anyone built a better one?  ;-)  This is the second (for me) of 2 mousetraps for this challenge and I bought some mousetraps to use in the challenge but didn''t have time to work on. This one is better than the previous in that the cutout seems more realistic.</td>', 'May be low tech, but has anyone built a better one?  ;-)  This is the second (for me) of 2 mousetraps for this challenge and I bought some mousetraps to use in the challenge but didn''t have time to work on. This one is better than the previous in that the cutout seems more realistic.', '2004-12-06 00:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048010, 121739, 28742, '<td valign="top">Boy, some folks have all the props!  ;-)  Nice, very nice.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-07 16:40:28.</i></td>', 'Boy, some folks have all the props!  ;-)  Nice, very nice.', '2004-12-06 00:17:36.000000', '2004-12-07 16:40:28.000000', 1),
(1048017, 124493, 28742, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Nice image. Clock is definitely low tech. ....what''s with the fruit??<br/> <br/>[edit after challenge]<br/>Thanks for telling me it was a scale. I did go back and bump up the score, since it made a WHOLE LOT more sense to me.  ;-) Looking again, I would just say it''s a little crowded. Like all that produce anxious to get weighed. ...and "accuracy"? hmmm, me thinks the scale''s tipped a bit and you''re over-charging for those grapes and over-ripened bananas.  ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-10 13:14:14.</i></td>', 'Interesting. Nice image. Clock is definitely low tech. ....what''s with the fruit?? [edit after challenge]Thanks for telling me it was a scale. I did go back and bump up the score, since it made a WHOLE LOT more sense to me.  ;-) Looking again, I would just say it''s a little crowded. Like all that produce anxious to get weighed. ...and "accuracy"? hmmm, me thinks the scale''s tipped a bit and you''re over-charging for those grapes and over-ripened bananas.  ;-)', '2004-12-06 00:19:51.000000', '2004-12-10 13:14:14.000000', 1),
(1048071, 124528, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!', '2004-12-06 00:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048083, 124351, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2004-12-06 00:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048368, 122250, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the boat gradienting off into the fog like that.</td>', 'Nice effect with the boat gradienting off into the fog like that.', '2004-12-06 05:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048371, 124236, 28261, '<td valign="top">A very nice presentation, but does not remind me of technology, even in the reference of the internent.  I really like the shard of light.  Considering this is a very low light situation, you have managed to eliminate a ton of noise, keep teh text very crisp and highlight exactly the point you are trying to make.  Good high marks for that, some loss due to the viewer''s persepective of technology.</td>', 'A very nice presentation, but does not remind me of technology, even in the reference of the internent.  I really like the shard of light.  Considering this is a very low light situation, you have managed to eliminate a ton of noise, keep teh text very crisp and highlight exactly the point you are trying to make.  Good high marks for that, some loss due to the viewer''s persepective of technology.', '2004-12-06 05:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048373, 123278, 28261, '<td valign="top">The image is well lit and very crisp.  The background is not distracting despite the uneven flow of fabric.  It seems very far away, I feel removed from the game and the low camera angle adds to my separation.  The downward slope of the board is uncomfortable and terminates too far from the frame edge. This viewer''s perspective does not place a chess set or board games into the technology realm although I understand there could be an implied link to the technology of video games and electronics in general.  A tighter crop, (enalrgement of the main subjects) and a slightly higher angle of camera or change in the angle of the board itself would greatly improve the viewing of the set and the overall impact.</td>', 'The image is well lit and very crisp.  The background is not distracting despite the uneven flow of fabric.  It seems very far away, I feel removed from the game and the low camera angle adds to my separation.  The downward slope of the board is uncomfortable and terminates too far from the frame edge. This viewer''s perspective does not place a chess set or board games into the technology realm although I understand there could be an implied link to the technology of video games and electronics in general.  A tighter crop, (enalrgement of the main subjects) and a slightly higher angle of camera or change in the angle of the board itself would greatly improve the viewing of the set and the overall impact.', '2004-12-06 05:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048376, 123756, 28261, '<td valign="top">Definitely low-tech.  The books seems at first to be a distraction but the image of the register itself is beautiful.  Despite its age and the damage, it is very clean and well presented.  The border seems just right, perhaps a bit on the thick side, but only compared to the size of the main subject.  Very impressed how the non-subjects and main subject manage to enforce the rule of 3rd''s and in some ways undo the ''this should not be here'' factor.</td>', 'Definitely low-tech.  The books seems at first to be a distraction but the image of the register itself is beautiful.  Despite its age and the damage, it is very clean and well presented.  The border seems just right, perhaps a bit on the thick side, but only compared to the size of the main subject.  Very impressed how the non-subjects and main subject manage to enforce the rule of 3rd''s and in some ways undo the ''this should not be here'' factor.', '2004-12-06 05:35:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1048378, 124803, 28261, '<td valign="top">I don''t find myself challenged at all to see a link to the technology.  We carry cels and pagers around everyday, even land phones for communication.  This is an excellent example of low tech communication.  The subjects are well framed and balance each other in height because of a good selection of shooting angle.  The disrepair of the home adds an element to the age of the bell, but the bell itself seems a bit over de-noised.  Like it has weathered time much more successfully than the home.  This seems a bit out of place.  Nice shot overall, not a glamour shot, but definitely fitting the challenge and well executed.</td>', 'I don''t find myself challenged at all to see a link to the technology.  We carry cels and pagers around everyday, even land phones for communication.  This is an excellent example of low tech communication.  The subjects are well framed and balance each other in height because of a good selection of shooting angle.  The disrepair of the home adds an element to the age of the bell, but the bell itself seems a bit over de-noised.  Like it has weathered time much more successfully than the home.  This seems a bit out of place.  Nice shot overall, not a glamour shot, but definitely fitting the challenge and well executed.', '2004-12-06 05:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048379, 124890, 28261, '<td valign="top">Choice of background, platform and angle are all very nice.  Use of natural lighting adds to the ambiance of a ''general store'' feel.  All of the hues coordinate with each other.  Slight flash reflection in the bottom of the scale but so minor as to almost not notice.  Us Amricans would see kilograms as metric and new fangled although it has been around for a long time and in use everywhere else forever.  The scale is definitely low tech compared to the new digital, bar code printing scales.  Nice shot</td>', 'Choice of background, platform and angle are all very nice.  Use of natural lighting adds to the ambiance of a ''general store'' feel.  All of the hues coordinate with each other.  Slight flash reflection in the bottom of the scale but so minor as to almost not notice.  Us Amricans would see kilograms as metric and new fangled although it has been around for a long time and in use everywhere else forever.  The scale is definitely low tech compared to the new digital, bar code printing scales.  Nice shot', '2004-12-06 05:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048382, 124196, 28261, '<td valign="top">Hard for me to see technology in this image, even low tech.  I''m sure hair restraint must have come a long way over the years, but that seems irrelevant.  There is a great amount of detail in the hair, but the overexposure of the lower left corner and last full braid thread really hurt the image.  The wayward strands are ''messy''.  It would seem even a perfect shot of a braid would need a lot of setup work to ensure that the polish on the final product was not taken away by random hair.</td>', 'Hard for me to see technology in this image, even low tech.  I''m sure hair restraint must have come a long way over the years, but that seems irrelevant.  There is a great amount of detail in the hair, but the overexposure of the lower left corner and last full braid thread really hurt the image.  The wayward strands are ''messy''.  It would seem even a perfect shot of a braid would need a lot of setup work to ensure that the polish on the final product was not taken away by random hair.', '2004-12-06 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048383, 124751, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the blur, the pattern of the bowl, color choices.  Eggs look a little too brown, like they may have been burned (PS not stove) a bit too much or simply did not catch enough light.  The framing and crop create a nice natural flow.  Although cooking utensils don''t immediately call to mind technology, I can easily see the comparison to hand mixers and food processors, so the link is there.  Nice pic.</td>', 'I like the blur, the pattern of the bowl, color choices.  Eggs look a little too brown, like they may have been burned (PS not stove) a bit too much or simply did not catch enough light.  The framing and crop create a nice natural flow.  Although cooking utensils don''t immediately call to mind technology, I can easily see the comparison to hand mixers and food processors, so the link is there.  Nice pic.', '2004-12-06 05:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048384, 122967, 28261, '<td valign="top">Do I consider pencil and paper low tech? (Yup, typing on a PC right now.)  DOF seems a bit too short in this one although it has achieved the goal of drawing my eye to the lead of the pencil and this is a plus.  Color cast seems less black on the pencil, than dark grey even a hint of green in the paper and pencil color. - (Could be the work monitor)  Very simple artistic presentation of the challenge; high marks.</td>', 'Do I consider pencil and paper low tech? (Yup, typing on a PC right now.)  DOF seems a bit too short in this one although it has achieved the goal of drawing my eye to the lead of the pencil and this is a plus.  Color cast seems less black on the pencil, than dark grey even a hint of green in the paper and pencil color. - (Could be the work monitor)  Very simple artistic presentation of the challenge; high marks.', '2004-12-06 06:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048386, 123977, 28261, '<td valign="top">The angle, dof, implied motion, shading and coloration all seem to work so well for this shot.  I can''t fold a plane anywhere near as perfectly as you made this one, so an extra point just for that.  Good crop, just enough sharpness, even the shape and placement of the tree behind adds to the composition.  There is no obstacle to seeing the link to technology and this is very low tech.  Only thing I can see and it is pickiness is that the tree''s blurring has that hypnotic zig-zag effect on my eyes, perhaps a bit more or less or a darkening of the background to lessen my dizziness. ;-)</td>', 'The angle, dof, implied motion, shading and coloration all seem to work so well for this shot.  I can''t fold a plane anywhere near as perfectly as you made this one, so an extra point just for that.  Good crop, just enough sharpness, even the shape and placement of the tree behind adds to the composition.  There is no obstacle to seeing the link to technology and this is very low tech.  Only thing I can see and it is pickiness is that the tree''s blurring has that hypnotic zig-zag effect on my eyes, perhaps a bit more or less or a darkening of the background to lessen my dizziness. ;-)', '2004-12-06 06:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048388, 124235, 28261, '<td valign="top">one of the few electric devices in this challenge that is so NOT electronic.  But the cloth in that plug seems like it is a fire hazard.  Nice detail in this. Great choice of a textured wall for background as it adds to the whole as does the angled jointing.  Good lighting too.  Nice high marks.</td>', 'one of the few electric devices in this challenge that is so NOT electronic.  But the cloth in that plug seems like it is a fire hazard.  Nice detail in this. Great choice of a textured wall for background as it adds to the whole as does the angled jointing.  Good lighting too.  Nice high marks.', '2004-12-06 06:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048426, 123484, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like the effect - clever title... one of my favorites this challenge -- back for a second look and making it a ribbon pick BOL</td>', 'really like the effect - clever title... one of my favorites this challenge -- back for a second look and making it a ribbon pick BOL', '2004-12-06 07:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048427, 121696, 14614, '<td valign="top">dynamic composition (not easy to pull off as I''ve tried!) One of my ribbon picks this challenge (small nit - framing/border overpowers just a bit)</td>', 'dynamic composition (not easy to pull off as I''ve tried!) One of my ribbon picks this challenge (small nit - framing/border overpowers just a bit)', '2004-12-06 07:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048428, 124974, 14614, '<td valign="top">simple composition fits the subject well, great framing... one of my ribbon picks this challenge</td>', 'simple composition fits the subject well, great framing... one of my ribbon picks this challenge', '2004-12-06 07:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048456, 124136, 12611, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great soul and feel to this shot. You deserve a ribbon for this.  So smoky and phallic. superb.</td>', 'Absolutely great soul and feel to this shot. You deserve a ribbon for this.  So smoky and phallic. superb.', '2004-12-06 08:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048604, 122337, 16241, '<td valign="top">different angle</td>', 'different angle', '2004-12-06 10:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048617, 124888, 25787, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love it.  Beautiful textures and composition.</td>', 'I absolutely love it.  Beautiful textures and composition.', '2004-12-06 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048618, 124525, 25787, '<td valign="top">I love the exposure, and the color you chose for the duotone.  Beautiful!</td>', 'I love the exposure, and the color you chose for the duotone.  Beautiful!', '2004-12-06 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048621, 121696, 25787, '<td valign="top">elegant photograph.  Beautiful tones.</td>', 'elegant photograph.  Beautiful tones.', '2004-12-06 10:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
