(1048845, 124371, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice, Crisp, Clear, Jumps off the screen with detail.  I miss the link to technology, unless this represents transportation.  Very effective use of desat and contrast.</td>', 'Nice, Crisp, Clear, Jumps off the screen with detail.  I miss the link to technology, unless this represents transportation.  Very effective use of desat and contrast.', '2004-12-06 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048847, 124701, 28261, '<td valign="top">Easily linked to technology and is low tech.  Subject seems too far away to have solid impact. Lighting is great however.  Good use of croparea in relation to the location of the subject, but the edge of the table is distracting on the right side.</td>', 'Easily linked to technology and is low tech.  Subject seems too far away to have solid impact. Lighting is great however.  Good use of croparea in relation to the location of the subject, but the edge of the table is distracting on the right side.', '2004-12-06 14:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048892, 123357, 28261, '<td valign="top">Where''s the needle?!!!!</td>', 'Where''s the needle?!!!!', '2004-12-06 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048899, 124084, 28261, '<td valign="top">A great inclusion of two low tech subjects!  I may have missed the construction had it not been for the title.  Very pleasant picture.  DOF just right to barely defocus the secondary subject.  Great detail in the wood and not oversaturated which lends to ''age''.</td>', 'A great inclusion of two low tech subjects!  I may have missed the construction had it not been for the title.  Very pleasant picture.  DOF just right to barely defocus the secondary subject.  Great detail in the wood and not oversaturated which lends to ''age''.', '2004-12-06 15:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
