(1048910, 124260, 28261, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, but the resolution size lacks in impact.</td>', 'Good choice of subject, but the resolution size lacks in impact.', '2004-12-06 15:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048912, 124984, 28261, '<td valign="top">Lol.  Should have saved this one for humor!  Good composition and crop, bit noisy in the shadows.  Does not seem truely low tech tho.</td>', 'Lol.  Should have saved this one for humor!  Good composition and crop, bit noisy in the shadows.  Does not seem truely low tech tho.', '2004-12-06 15:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048917, 124447, 28261, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of low tech and well exposed.  unsure if the angle is intended or if this is simply a need to use the rotation tool.  I feel like I''m sliding off the side of the composition which hurts the impact of this otherwise very good photo.</td>', 'This is a great example of low tech and well exposed.  unsure if the angle is intended or if this is simply a need to use the rotation tool.  I feel like I''m sliding off the side of the composition which hurts the impact of this otherwise very good photo.', '2004-12-06 15:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048918, 124883, 28261, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene.  Hazy, but muted coloring pushes it into an artistic feel.  Now a days I think high tech when I see lighthouses.  Could miss the low tech link.</td>', 'A beautiful scene.  Hazy, but muted coloring pushes it into an artistic feel.  Now a days I think high tech when I see lighthouses.  Could miss the low tech link.', '2004-12-06 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048928, 124959, 28261, '<td valign="top">Textures and fine detail jump off the screen.   Simple subject shows its age and link to technology is easily compared to modern cleaning devices.  Personally disinterested in a broom, but this is well presented and worthy of high marks. Bumping up.</td>', 'Textures and fine detail jump off the screen.   Simple subject shows its age and link to technology is easily compared to modern cleaning devices.  Personally disinterested in a broom, but this is well presented and worthy of high marks. Bumping up.', '2004-12-06 15:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048930, 124545, 28261, '<td valign="top">I cannot help but think electronics when I see this type of camera.  It is well shot, detail and texure are very fine.  Looks like I could touch the side of the cam and feel the roughness.  Refelction in lens is perfectly placed.  Seems a bit overexposed on the base of the lens connector.</td>', 'I cannot help but think electronics when I see this type of camera.  It is well shot, detail and texure are very fine.  Looks like I could touch the side of the cam and feel the roughness.  Refelction in lens is perfectly placed.  Seems a bit overexposed on the base of the lens connector.', '2004-12-06 15:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048944, 123681, 28261, '<td valign="top">The subjects inadverdantly frame the screen door bringing a lot of focus to it.  I think desaturation here may have detracted from the whole.  Would like to see the red of the swiss army knife and the weathering of the hiking boot.  The item in the lower right corner is washed out and distracting.</td>', 'The subjects inadverdantly frame the screen door bringing a lot of focus to it.  I think desaturation here may have detracted from the whole.  Would like to see the red of the swiss army knife and the weathering of the hiking boot.  The item in the lower right corner is washed out and distracting.', '2004-12-06 15:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048960, 124906, 25754, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, shot at a good angle, and I like your choice of colours. Lighting is harsh and has created shadows that are way too dark. Adding another light source coming from the opposite direction as your other light would have made this better, I think.</td>', 'Nice composition, shot at a good angle, and I like your choice of colours. Lighting is harsh and has created shadows that are way too dark. Adding another light source coming from the opposite direction as your other light would have made this better, I think.', '2004-12-06 16:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
