(1049093, 124926, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like this concept of spokes casting outward to the frame, but found myself looking at the chipped paint in the background rather than the derailer which seemed beaten up either by use, poor lighting, focus or simply having been off center and not tighly enough shot.  I can see technology of some kind here as it seems mechanical and somewhat old, but the distraction of the rest of the focal points seems to easily outweigh its statement.</td>', 'I like this concept of spokes casting outward to the frame, but found myself looking at the chipped paint in the background rather than the derailer which seemed beaten up either by use, poor lighting, focus or simply having been off center and not tighly enough shot.  I can see technology of some kind here as it seems mechanical and somewhat old, but the distraction of the rest of the focal points seems to easily outweigh its statement.', '2004-12-06 17:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
