(1049141, 122389, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice touch to have it ringing.  I like the title very much.</td>', 'Nice touch to have it ringing.  I like the title very much.', '2004-12-06 18:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049142, 124785, 12573, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, if a little cliche.  Your cheese is looking a little too orange for me...perhaps bring down the saturation 3-4 points.  The depth of field is quite good and gets the point across fine.  The glares coming off the tile floor are a little distraction, as is the dark grout.  I think a really high-key effect, with the floor and background totally white and the OOF (out of focus) portion of the trap blending into the background would have been nice.  Overall, a fine effort though...worthy of a 6.</td>', 'The composition is good, if a little cliche.  Your cheese is looking a little too orange for me...perhaps bring down the saturation 3-4 points.  The depth of field is quite good and gets the point across fine.  The glares coming off the tile floor are a little distraction, as is the dark grout.  I think a really high-key effect, with the floor and background totally white and the OOF (out of focus) portion of the trap blending into the background would have been nice.  Overall, a fine effort though...worthy of a 6.', '2004-12-06 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049144, 124701, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good title and the tabletop works well with this hardware.</td>', 'Good title and the tabletop works well with this hardware.', '2004-12-06 18:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
