(1049519, 124972, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the hi key in this very much as well as the great reflections in the knife and the wonderful colors.  Not a real pepper fan, food wise, but the doo make for an interesting, colorful subject. My only nit is to have had some more green up front, but the composition works well without it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Like the hi key in this very much as well as the great reflections in the knife and the wonderful colors.  Not a real pepper fan, food wise, but the doo make for an interesting, colorful subject. My only nit is to have had some more green up front, but the composition works well without it.  Good luck!', '2004-12-06 21:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049524, 124572, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice composition great colors.....I think I would have shot this bit further back to pick up more of the colors and pattern of the finished weave in the right bottom corner. Nice detail.</td>', 'Nice composition great colors.....I think I would have shot this bit further back to pick up more of the colors and pattern of the finished weave in the right bottom corner. Nice detail.', '2004-12-06 21:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
