(1049609, 122505, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition, good background.  It would have been good to not crop the top of the shovel.  Perhaps warmer light (or adjustment) might have been nice too.</td>', 'Nice simple composition, good background.  It would have been good to not crop the top of the shovel.  Perhaps warmer light (or adjustment) might have been nice too.', '2004-12-06 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049612, 124623, 7151, '<td valign="top">I think it might have been really interesting if the label of the can were completely obscured or in shadow.  Its just a tiny bit distracting.  Otherwise, the focus is drawn well to the subject.  I like the composition.  The exposure is good.</td>', 'I think it might have been really interesting if the label of the can were completely obscured or in shadow.  Its just a tiny bit distracting.  Otherwise, the focus is drawn well to the subject.  I like the composition.  The exposure is good.', '2004-12-06 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049615, 124978, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the progression of the dam through the picture.  Perhaps might have cropped the bottom 1/2 inch or so, those trees are a bit dominating.  By cropping tighter, you might have played even more off of the diagonal for composition (it does this already to a lesser extent, using the bottom of the dam.)  But is a DAM low tech?</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the progression of the dam through the picture.  Perhaps might have cropped the bottom 1/2 inch or so, those trees are a bit dominating.  By cropping tighter, you might have played even more off of the diagonal for composition (it does this already to a lesser extent, using the bottom of the dam.)  But is a DAM low tech?', '2004-12-06 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
