(1049741, 124371, 22533, '<td valign="top">Wow, my first ribbon! Thanks everyone for the great comments. I really enjoyed taking this picture. At first, I was just going to submit it in B&amp;W, but then I realized that it was a member challenge! This was my first selective desat., and I am happy with how it turned out. I think it works well, because the wagon is the "low tech" subject of the picture. <br/> <br/>A few people mentioned the white line behind Ethan''s head. That is the brim of the baseball cap. I wanted the hat to be on backwards, but it moved to his left during shooting. Oh well, I am just happy I got the shot.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!<br/>Chad</td>', 'Wow, my first ribbon! Thanks everyone for the great comments. I really enjoyed taking this picture. At first, I was just going to submit it in B&W, but then I realized that it was a member challenge! This was my first selective desat., and I am happy with how it turned out. I think it works well, because the wagon is the "low tech" subject of the picture.  A few people mentioned the white line behind Ethan''s head. That is the brim of the baseball cap. I wanted the hat to be on backwards, but it moved to his left during shooting. Oh well, I am just happy I got the shot. Thanks again!Chad', '2004-12-07 00:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
