(1049807, 122250, 22781, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everybody for voting and taking the time to comment.<br/> <br/>For everybody who was asking or just thinking if this was a real ship or a model:<br/><b>It''s Real!</b> <br/>It''s a 1:1 replica of the batavia.<br/>And if you like to know more or just want to see NICE photo''s of it go to the official website: <a href="//www.bataviawerf.nl/en/index.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bataviawerf</a></td>', 'Thanks to everybody for voting and taking the time to comment. For everybody who was asking or just thinking if this was a real ship or a model:It''s Real! It''s a 1:1 replica of the batavia.And if you like to know more or just want to see NICE photo''s of it go to the official website: Bataviawerf', '2004-12-07 01:07:51.000000', NULL, 0),
