(1050088, 123717, 12311, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented during and after the challenge.  I sincerely appreciate it.  I was beginning to think that I would very likely never win a ribbon.  Then, when the admins excluded from this challenge the likes of heida, kiwiness, jmsetzler, bradp, and others too numerous to list, I thought "Wow, at last...  Maybe now I have a chance!"<br/> <br/>Anyway, I didn''t see an asterisk on my ribbon... ;-)<br/> <br/>Thanks again!!<br/> <br/>-len</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented during and after the challenge.  I sincerely appreciate it.  I was beginning to think that I would very likely never win a ribbon.  Then, when the admins excluded from this challenge the likes of heida, kiwiness, jmsetzler, bradp, and others too numerous to list, I thought "Wow, at last...  Maybe now I have a chance!" Anyway, I didn''t see an asterisk on my ribbon... ;-) Thanks again!! -len', '2004-12-07 09:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1050110, 124819, 10413, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all the comments and voting on my photo. I was very pleased with the results.  I wasn''t sure how well this photo would do.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeneralE:</b></div><hr/><i> I think I recognize the cookbook too, but I''m not sure -- hope it''s posted in the notes. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I cropped out just the cook book so you could see it. I was given this by my great grandmother and to tell you the truth I have no idea how old it is.  There are no dates at all inside it. As you can see it''s in very brittle shape and some of the pages are missing.  It''s so much fun to read though.  Especially all the old remedies in it.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=126644" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10413/thumb/126644.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10413/thumb/126644.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10413/thumb/126644.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks everyone for all the comments and voting on my photo. I was very pleased with the results.  I wasn''t sure how well this photo would do. Originally posted by GeneralE: I think I recognize the cookbook too, but I''m not sure -- hope it''s posted in the notes.   I cropped out just the cook book so you could see it. I was given this by my great grandmother and to tell you the truth I have no idea how old it is.  There are no dates at all inside it. As you can see it''s in very brittle shape and some of the pages are missing.  It''s so much fun to read though.  Especially all the old remedies in it.', '2004-12-07 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
